<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">JOHN - Kuman</book>
  <para style="h">Jon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jon</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jon</para>
  <para style="mt">Jon</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">God siragl mere moglkwa i, Jisas i nogugl ede norukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Okna kaima ibo taragl ta plau dikrukwa igne, Ka mogl kodugwa. Ka i God bogl akie miurka te, Ka i yene God moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Oknayene Ibo ye God bogl miurka. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Te, Ka i taragl mudu ere yogwa. Taragl mudu yene ta plau dikrikwa. Ye taragl mudu ere yogwa keme paigwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Kor meglkwa mabuno i, ye mem moglkwa. Te, ye kor moglmara i, yoba abuglage si togwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Abuglage i, si mim erumara edugwa. Te, mim ere mogl, abuglage si goginagledi erukwa i, kuno erekrukwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Ana God ere mogl, yagl ta kogon dedugwa, ye kagie Jon we digwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Jon udre, Abuglage siragl mere moglkwa di poran, yoba mudu pre medraiglkwa pre God ye dedugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Jon yene Abuglage moglkrukwa ba Abuglage di poragledi ugwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Abuglage i, Abuglage kaima moglsre, yoba mudu abuglage si tenagledi ede makadigle ugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Ye ede makanagle ugwa ba taragl mudu ye ere yogwa meglkwa i, ye kan pogl sikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Ye yene yobama meglmara ugwa ba ye yobama ye ta kan, di ikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ba yoba tau ye ira moglkwa pre kan ersre, pre mediglkwa i, ye God gagiglma moraiglmedi ere edugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Yoba u God gagiglema eigwa i, gak kiglmere mere yegl mo yoba yobuglno mina mo yoba nomaneno mina mo i ta manugwa. God swara ere edugo, u gagiglma eigwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Ka i u yoba pidre, ede makandigle ugo, no yoba bogl akie munga. Mungo, ye siragl mere wakai yene moglkwa i kamga. Wakai yene moglmedi kamga i, God Wam swara moglkwa i, wakai yene yegl morabuka. Te, ye moglkwa i, ye ege ege dem muduo yoko kaima norsre, ka kaima keme di norukwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Ana yagl Jon ikra we, ye yoba di nogugl ede tedre, ka podo yegl dugwa, Na okna ene di te, Yagl ta okuo udre, Yagl Kade mogl, na egre narabe diga i, yoba i pre diga. Na moglkrika igne, ye okna kaima ibo moglkwa pre ye Yagl Kade mogl, na egre narumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />God Wam moglkwa i, dem muduo podo norukwa pre ye nono ege ege yoko kaima ere wakai ere noro moglkwa. Ye mabunomo i ta dudukrukwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ene prio! God lomo i, ye Moses togo, Moses i nogugl edugwa ba God dem muduo yoko kaima norukwa ya ka kaima di nogugl ede norukwa mabunomo i, ye Jisas Krais mina i nogugl ede norukwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Nono yoba munga i, ege swara ta gumuglno mina God kankrumga. God Wam swara ye God Nem bogl swara kaima miurko, te ye ama God moglkwa i, ye swara God Nem siragl mere moglkwa i, i nogugl ede norukwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jon ye ira moglkwa i, Israel yoba kade di pogl togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matyu 3.1-12</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">Mak 1.7-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:15-17">Luk 3.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19-20" />Ana Juda yoba kade dumo Jerusalem meglkwa i ere mogl, yoba tau ye Jon moglmara pidre, kira pogl praiglmedi dedigo, eigwa. Ye tawa teigwa yoba tau ya Livai yoba tau dedigo, ye pidre, Jon yegl di prikwa, God Kere Yugwa Yagl Krais unabe digwa ikra, ene yagl i motnga uno? di, yegl di prikwa. Di priko, Jon nogugl di ikne ede te, Na ta moglkrie dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:19-20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Yegl dugo, ye aglke kor di prisre, Ene ira motne? Ene Elaija ikra motnga, uno? digwa. Digo, Jon, Na ta moglkrie dugwa. Dugo, ye, Ka Kep Yagl ta unabe digwa i, motno? digwa. Digo, Jon, Na ta manumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Dugo, ye yegl di teigwa, Ene ira motnga i, no di noro. Di notn, Juda yoba kade no dedigwa i, kanen prisre, ede ikne pi ye di tenamga. Ene ira kaima mole dine? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yegl digo, Jon ye di tedre, God kamo kep yagl ta okna moglkwa, kagie Aisaia we digwa i, ye okna yegl dugwa, Yagl ta okuo dumo wau yomara moglsre, yoba ka kade di te, yegl dinabe dugwa, Yagl Kade unabara ene konbaunamo ake kun ersre, ere wakai erio!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 40.3</char></note> dinabe dugwa. Na yagl i moluwe di, Jon yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Ana yoba Jon ka kira peglkwa i, Farisi ye dedigwa wigwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Ye kira kor yegl di prikwa, Ene Krais moglkrie didre, Elaija moglkrie didre, God kamo kep yagl ta unabuka i, ene ama ta moglkrie dinga. Ene yoba yegl moglkitnga pre siragl eruko, ene yoba ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl tene? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26-27" />Yegl digo, Jon di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Na ede okna pidre, yoba ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl teiga. Na kogon yegl erika ba yagl ta na moknamugl udre, kogon podo erabuka i, erme nono adigl munara magigl i, suna adigl moglkwa. Ye magigl i adigl moglkwa ba ene ye guma dra ta kankrime dugwa. Ye yagl kade kaima mogl, na egre narukwa. Ye yagl wakai kaima moglko, na yagl wakai ta moglkrika pre na ye niglmo kogonmo yoba mere yegl moglsre, kagle towo kan poko edenaglka i, na kuno ta erekriwe di, Jon yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:26-27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Yoba u Jon moglmara kira peglkwa i, Jon yoba nigl Jordan nigl bugl tomara koglo ibo dumo ta Betani we digwa i, Jon moglko, digwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jon ere mogl Jisas ye God sipsipmo nagigle moglme dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Behold the Lamb" file="FM 138 Behold the Lamb_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="1.29" />Ana tagugo i, Jisas ye Jon moglmara ugo, Jon ye kandre, yoba magigl meglkwa i yegl di togwa, Yagl ta ugwa iro kanio! dugwa. Ye God sisipmo nagigle ugwa. Ye yoba mudu tadaglmeno gugl edenabuka yagl moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Na okna ye pre digra, Yagl ta na moknamugl unabuka i, ye na moglkrika igne okna kaima ibo moglkwa pre ye kade mogl, na egrume diga. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Na Israel yoba ake nigl atne ede, nigl bugl teiga i, yagl ta na moknamugl unabe diga ikra unan, yoba ye kan pogl sinaiglkwa pre kogon yegl eriwe dugwa. Na kogon yegl erika ba yagl ta unabe diga i, na ama ye ira moglkwa i, okna pre kan erekriwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Na taragl swara ta kandre, yagl ugwa iro ye yagl ta unabuka ikra moglmedi kan pogl sie dugwa. Na kan moglko, God Murubuglo heven ibo mogl, kua yumugl pru dumere mere yegl pru di ede atne u ye moglmara pai moglko, kanie dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Na yegl ta kankria, ye ira moglkwa i ta kan pogl sikriko, ba God, na yoba nigl bugl tenatnedi dedugwa i, okna yegl di narukwa, Na Murubuglona ede atne u yagl swara ta moglmara aimadi mogl tenan, ene kanatniwe dugwa. Yagl swara i ere mogl, Mudu Murubuglo ama yoba tenabiwe di, God yegl di narume dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Ana God ye ene taragl yegl ta kanatne dugwa ikra na kaniga pre na ene erme di teiga, yagl erme ugwa iro, ye God Wam moglmiwe di, Jon yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl tau koragle Jisas duglo beglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Ana tagna ta i, Jon ye aglke kor nigl Jordan bina ye duglo biurka yagl suo bogl adigl meglko, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Jisas wogwa. Wogo, Jon kandre, ye duglo biurka yagl suo i di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl ta God sipsipmo nagigle moglme diga ikra wogwa iro wa, kaniro! di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Jon yegl dugo, ye duglo biurka yagl suo i prisre, Jisas omara sika si ede ebrika. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Sika si ede ebriko, Jisas kan ikne ede, ye ubrika i kandre, yegl dugwa, Ene siragl pre na mokna kogl, na sika si ubre? di, yegl dugwa. Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, yagl suo i di ikne edibrika, Rabai, ene yugu aglo mere pai motnga i, kanabugledi ubugle dibrika. Ye Rabai we dibrika i, ye kano mina Neno Yagle mere yegl dibrika. <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Ana yagl suo i ka yegl dibriko, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ana, ene kanabra, wiro! di, yegl dugwa. Dugo, yagl suo i ye Jisas omara sika si pidre, ye yugu aglo mere paugwa i kan, ege swara i Jisas bogl akie wan ede pi paigwa. I siragl pre ye Jisas kandre, sika si ede ebrika igne i min paugwa, 4 klok mere yegl yogwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Ana Jon duglo biurka yagl suo ye Jon ka dugwa i prisre, Jisas sika si ede ebrika i, swara ta kagie Andru, ye Saimon Pita agigle moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andru ye Jisas moglmara kide kodidre, tabre kana pi ye agigle Saimon doko kandre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, No God Kere Yugwa Yagl, Mesaia we digwa ikra, kanumniwe dugwa. Mesaia i, ka Grik mina Krais we digwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Ana Andru ye agigle Saimon ka yegl di tedre, agre i pi Jisas moglmara edugwa. Edugo, Jisas ye Saimon kandre, yegl dugwa, Ene yagl ta kagie Jon we digwa i wam motngo, kagn Saimon we digwa. Yegl digwa ba na erme ene kagn kor yei teiga. Ene kagn kor i, Sifas pamiwe dugwa. Kagie Sifas i, ka Grik mina Pita we digwa. Sifas ya Pita i, suo akie mabuno swara paugwa. Mabuno i, Kobuglo.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ana tagugo i, Jisas ye dumo ta moglmara i kide kodidre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede distrik Galili enamnedi prukwa. Yegl prukwa ba ye komono kana pi yagl ta kagie Filip we digwa i doko kandre, ye di te, Na duglo boglo dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Yagl Filip i ye Andru ya Pita bogl dumo swara nem meglkwa. Dumo i, kagie Betsaida we digwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Ana Jisas ye Filip di te, na duglo boglo dugwa mokomugl i, Filip ede pi yagl ta kagie Nataniel doko kandre, ye yegl di togwa, Moses ya kap kep yoba tau okna ka bogl atne edidre, yagl ta unabe digwa i, kamniwa. Ye kagie Jisas, Josep wam moglsre, dumo Nasaret nem moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Ye yegl dugo, Nataniel di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Dumo Nasaret i, taragl wakai swara ta plau dinan, kankramnedi prie dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba Filip ye aglke kor di te, yagl Jisas i kanatna wo! dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Ana Filip ye ka yegl mere Nataniel di togo, ye akie ede Jisas moglmara enabugledi ede ebrika. Ede ebriko, Jisas ye Nataniel ugwa i kandre, Nataniel pre yegl dugwa, Yagl ta ugwa i, ye Israel yoba kaima moglko, ka kibi mabuno ye moglmara ta paikrumiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Jisas yegl dugo, Nataniel ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene siragl mere na kan pogl sidre, yegl dine? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Filip ene motnara pidre, ene agle dikrukwa igne, ene ede fik mabuno mina motngo, na ene kaniwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Dugo, Nataniel ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Tisa, ene God Wam moglsre, Israel yoba kingno motniwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yegl dugo, Jisas aglke kor ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene ede fik mabuno mina motngo, na ene kanie diga i pre ene na pre mediglno? dugwa. I taragl kebra yogwa. Na okuo taragl tau podo eribo, ene kanatniwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oknayene Ibo 28.12</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Jisas ye Nataniel yegl di tedre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl mudu ama yegl di togwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Kamun mitna ibo ede u koglo koglo enan, yoba lada mina ede egli pidre, ede atne udre, erimere mere yegl, God angeloma na Yoba Wam moglka i, moraglmara i mina ede egli pidre, ede atne udre, eribi, ene kanaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Jisas nigl kor ere i wain koglo edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Filling jugs" file="lb00135b.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="2.1" />Okuo, ege suo ede ogo, dumo ta Kana we dimara, distrik Galili suna yogwa i, yagl abu suo ta bogl ibriko, yoba kaya mokna podo ere nenamnedi makai si meglkwa. Ye makai si meglmara suna i, Jisas mam ama moglko, <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />te yoba ye ama Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl di gaiglko, wigwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Ye u suna meglko, yoba kaya mokna nedre, nigl wain nedre, ere meglko, nigl wain dudugwa. Dudugo, Jisas mam pi Jisas moglmara di tedre, Yoba nigl wain nenaiglkwa i, dudumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne edidre yegl dugwa, Mana yo, ene siragl pre na di natne? Na kimagl eraglka egena ta yeikrumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Jisas yegl dugwa ba ye mam ere mogl, yugu nem niglmo kogonmo yoba tau meglkwa i di te, yegl dugwa, Na wana ka siragl mere ta ene di tenabuka i, ye dinabere sika si erio di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Ana yugu ta yoba makai si meglmara i, nigl migi kobuglo mina bekigwa 6-pela yogwa. Nigl migi i, ye Juda yoba ebrie mabunono pamere i, ogono kaglno nigl koraiglkwa pre yeigo, swara swarade 100 lita mere yegl toide atne edibi, kau sinabuka yogwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Ana Jisas ere mogl, yugugl i nigl kogon yoba ta meglkwa i di te, yegl dugwa, Ene nigl kogl yu, nigl migi 6-pela i mudu kogl kau sio dugwa. Yegl dugo, nigl kogon yoba ye dumere ere, kogl kau sigwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8-9" />Kogl kau sigo, Jisas nigl i ere i wain edidre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene nigl migi i mina nigl tau kogl i pi, yagl ta kaya mokna sugl moglkwa i, tebi, ye ne prabiwe dugwa. Dugo, ye tau kogl i pi teigo, yagl i ne prukwa. Yagl i, ye nigl kogon yoba aglo mere kogl yuigwa i ta pre kan erekrukwa ba nigl kogon yoba i keme pre kan erikwa. Ana ye ne prisre, yagl abu suo bogl ibrika yagl i agle dugo, ugwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />Ugo, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Aya, yoba kaya mokna podo yegl neigwa igne, yoba ege ege nigl wain kuglo wakai erukwa i komono kana teigo, neigwa. Mere ne kodigo, ye okuo nigl wain kuglo wakai ta erekrukwa i, yoba nenaiglmedi teime dugwa. Yoba ege ege yegl erikwa, ba ene yegl ta erekitne dugwa. Nigl wain kuglo wakai erukwa i, ene okuo i notniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Ana Jisas kimagl yegl erukwa i, dumo Kana, distrik Galili suna yomara i moglsre, erukwa. Te, ye kimagl i koragle ersre, kimagl tau mudu erukwa i, okuo erukwa. Ye kimagl i ersre, yobuglomo ya kagie kade i nogugl edugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i kandre, ye pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Ana okuo Jisas yogo, ye mam ya agiglema yeigo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i bogl dumo Kana i kide kodidre, ede pi dumo Kaperneam pidre, kuri ta meglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawa teigwa yugu yomara yoba taragl tau topo beglkwa i, Jisas si meda edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matyu 21.12-13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mak 11.15-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Ana Juda yoba ere mogl, God okna ibo ye kowano awano oglo si pidre, Isip yoba wano komono si goglkwa i pre moraiglkwa ege i ede magigl ugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede Jerusalem eigwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Ede Jerusalem eigo, Jisas ede pi tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pidre, kanugwa i, yoba kau ya sipsip ya kua yumugl topo beglko, te mige topo suade erikwa yoba ama tebol mina ame di mogl, mige topo suade eriko, kanugwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Jisas taragl yegl erikwa i kandre, kide pre, kan tau magigl i yogwa i idre, ake pema si, ere i duglnai mere yegl edidre, duglnai i mina yoba maket ere meglkwa i ya sipsip ya kau togl suna meglkwa i pra, si meda edugwa. Si meda edidre, mige topo suade erikwa yoba i, tebolno ake yake tedre, mige mogono pia si bage bage edugwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Yegl ersre, te yoba ta kua yumugl mige beglkwa i di te, yegl dugwa, Ene kua yumugl topo beglkwa i, i ede meda pio! Na Nina yugumo maket mere ta edekrio! dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Yegl dugwa pre ye duglo beglkwa yagl prikwa, God kamo mina okna ibo bage ta yegl beglkwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 2:17">Ene yugunen wakai yenabedi nomane sidre, pre mitna edinaluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 69.9</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 2:17">di, yegl beglkwa, te erme ye beglmere i, Jisas erumiwe di, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl prikwa.<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Ana Jisas yegl ere, tawa teigwa yugu yomara yoba si meda edugo, Juda yoba kade tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna meglkwa i kandre, Jisas yegl di teigwa, Ene taragl yegl etnga i, God ene ta dedenan, ene etn, kuno erabuka ba ta manan, kuno erekrabiwe digwa. Yegl pre ene kimagl siragl mere etn, no kandre, God kaima ene dedumedi pramne? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene God yugumo magigl i si gur di atne edidre, ere kide eribi, na ege suota keme ke ikne edinaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Dugo, Juda yoba kade yegl digwa, God yugumo magigl i, yoba bugla yugu 46-pela kei meglko, dudumiwe digwa. Ene pitnga i, ege suota mina kor kenatnga i kuno erabedi pitno? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ye yegl digwa ba Jisas ye God yugumo we dugwa i, ye ka padum didre, yene ogo nagie pre dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Yegl pre okuo Jisas goglsre, adigl u kor ogwa igne, ye duglo beglkwa yagl pre ikne edidre, Jisas ye ka ta Juda yoba kade di ikne ede togwa i pre mogl, ye kaima dumedi prisre, te God kamo okna Jisas adigl u kor enabuka pre dugwa i ama kaima dumedi pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Ana Juda yoba dumo Jerusalem ege kade yogwa pre makai sidre, God okna ibo ye kowano awano oglo sugwa igne pre meglko, Jisas ye meglmara suna wan mogl, kimagl mere erukwa. Eruko, yoba mere kandre, ye Jisas pre mediglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24-25" />Yoba mere ye pre mediglkwa ba Jisas ye yoba i tau mere okuo nomane suo idre, adigl gigledi moglkraiglmedi pre kan ere kodugwa. I siragl pre yoba siragl mere munga ya deno muduno siragl mere paugwa i, yoba ye Jisas di tenaiglkwa ta paikrukwa. Yene pre kan ere kodugwa.<verse eid="JHN 2:24-25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Jisas Nikodemus ka beke togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus and Nicodemus" file="C063 bw NT.tif" size="col" copy="New Tribes Mission" ref="3.1" />Ana Juda yagl kade ta moglkwa, kagie Nikodemus we digwa. Ye Farisi yagl ta moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Ana aglke ta yagl Nikodemus i eduer Jisas moglmara ugwa. Udre, ye yegl di togwa, Tisa yo, God ene ka mabuno beke noratnedi dedugo, unga i, no tau pre kan erumniwe dugwa. I siragl pre ene kimagl etnga i, no kandre, God ka kaima ene motnara mogl tomedi pre pogl sumniwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, yoba ta u kor pikran, ye God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabara i, suna ta pikrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, Nikodemus aglke kor yegl dugwa, Yoba ta kade mogl kodugwa i, ye siragl mere u kor enabe? dugwa. Ye aglke kor mam dane wagle enan, mam ye kor kurabuka pre dino? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Na yegl pre dikrika. Na ene ka kaima di teiga, God yoba ta nigl mere yegl pai tedre, te Murubuglo mina ye ere i kor edenan, yoba i keme ede suna enabuka. Ta manan, ye God yoba kingno mogl, ye suglno morabara suna ta pikrabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esekiel 36.24-27 kano. God kamo bage i mina ye Israel yoba okuo di togwa i, Na ene nigl pai tebo, ene pe sinabe dugwa. Te, ye ama dugwa i, Na Murubuglona ene tenabe dugwa. Jisas ka ta nigl ya Murubuglo pre dugwa i, ye ka i idre, dugwa paugwa.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Jisas ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ogono nagino mina ere mogl, gak kiglkwa i, ogono nagino bogl kiglkwa. Ba yoba kiano wagle u kor enaiglkwa i, God Murubuglo swara eran, u kor enaiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Na ene di te, Ene u kor enaiglkwa pame diga i, ene gagn koglkro! dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Ir magugwa i pro! Ir ugwa i, ene pitnga, ba ir ugwa konbo i ene kankre, ogwa konbo i, ene ama gumugln mina ta kankitnga. Kuno yegl mere, God Murubuglo ye yoba ere i kor edenabuka i, ye kiano mina erabuka pre ene gugmugln mina ta kankratniwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, Nikodemus ye yegl di prukwa, Ene yoba u kor enaiglkwa pame dinga i, siragl mere plau dinabe? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene Israel yoba ka mabuno beke tenga yagl motnga pre na ka diga i, ene pre pogl sinatnga paugwa ba ene ta pre pogl sikitne dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Na ene ka kaima di teiga, No taragl tau kandre, pre pogl sidre, erumga i, ene di tomga ba ene no kaima dimedi prikrime dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Na taragl tau makandigle plau dinabuka i keme ene di teigo, ene pre mediglkrikwa. Yegl pre na taragl tau heven ibo plau dinabuka i ta ene di tebo, ene pre medraiglkwa i ta kuno erekrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Yoba ta ede heven ibo pi kandre, ede ikne ukrikwa pre ye ene heven pre di tenaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa. Na swara, Yoba Wam moglka i, heven ibo moglsre, ede atne wiga pre na swara ene di tenaglka i kuno erumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Snake on pole" file="CO00863B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="3.14" />Ana Jisas ka yegl didre, ye ama yegl di togwa, Moses okna ibo dumo wau yomara toki kide ta beke, ede wagle padiglsre, i mitna edumere mere yegl, na Yoba Wam moglka i, okuo yoba na ama yegl ede mina padigl, na ake i mitna edenaiglkwa pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />Yegl eribi, yoba ira ta na pre medrabuka i, aimadi kamin kor morabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />God yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, dem muduo ka kaima togwa pre na Ye Wam swara moglka i, dedugo, wiga. Yegl pre yoba ira ta na pre medrabuka i, goglkre, kor aimadi kamin morabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Na God Wam moglka i, God na di narsre, Yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ka tage tenatna, po! dugo, ta ukrika. Ta manugwa. Ye, Yoba mudu uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ere inatnedi dedugo, wiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Yoba ta na pre meduglkwa i, God ye ka tage ta tekrabuka. Ba yoba na pre mediglkrukwa i, ye ka tage tenagledi di padigl kodugwa. Na God Wam swara moglka i, pre mediglkrukwa pre di padigl kodume dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />God ye yoba tau ka tage tenagledi di padigl kodugwa i, i siragl pre na abuglage si tenagledi ede atne makandigle wiga ba yoba mim erumara moglsre, mabuno kide ere meglkwa pre ye na kide pre narsre, mim erukwa i wakai pre teigwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Yoba ira ta mabuno kide erikwa i, ye abuglage sugwa i kide pre tedre, ye mabuno kide erikwa i, yoba kan dinaiglmedi ede u abuglage sumara ukrimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Yegl erikwa ba yoba ta ka kaima duglo beglkwa i, ye ede abuglage sumara wime dugwa. I siragl pre ye prikwa i, mabuno wakai nogugl eun, yoba kandre, God no yobuglo noruko, erimiwedi, yoba yegl kanaiglmedi primiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jon ye Jisas ira moglkwa i, di nogugl edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Ana okuo Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede meda pi distrik Judia suna i ege tau akie wan meglko, Jisas yoba nigl bugl togwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Togo, Jon ama dumo ta Ainon we digwa i, dumo ta Salim we dimara magigl yogwa i, moglsre, yoba nigl bugl te moglkwa. Dumo i, nigl nubun tau mere moglkwa pre ye dumo i moglko, yoba ta nigl buramnedi prikwa i ye moglmara eigo, Jon ye nigl bugl togwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Ege i, yoba Jon si kane sikrikwa igne yegl erukwa ba okuo Jon ye si kane sigwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Ana igne i, Juda yagl swara ta ugo, ye Jon duglo beglkwa yagl bogl nonga digwa. Ye nonga digwa i, Juda yoba mabunono pamere yegl, yoba ta ogono kaglno nigl keglbi, yoba i God gumuglo mina deno muduno pe sinabo mo sikrabo mo i pre nonga digwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Digo, ye Jon moglmara udre, yegl digwa, Tisa yo, ene okna nigl Jordan koglo ibo motngo, yagl ta ene motnara ugo, ene ye ira moglkwa i yoba di pogl tenga yaglmo ikra we, ye yoba nigl bugl te moglko, yoba mudu nono munara ukre, ye moglmara keme eimiwe di, yoba yegl dime digwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yegl digo, Jon di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, God yene heven ibo moglsre, kogon swara swarade tenan keme inaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Na God Kere Yugwa Yagl Krais ta moglkriwe diga i, na drana mina prisre, Yagl i unabara ede okna enatnedi na dedumiwe diga i, ene ama drana mina prime dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Ana Jon ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ka ebrie ta dibo, ene praiglmiwe dugwa. Yagl abu ta bogl inabrika igne, abu i ere mogl, ye wie moglmara enabuka ba komono kana yagl kabaglemo, abu kep yagl ta abu nem agiglema bogl meglmara ede okna pidre, taragl mudu ere wakai ersre, yaglmo i unabedi sugl morabuka. Sugl moran, yaglmo i ede abu moglmara udre, ye ebie agle dinabuka igne, yagl kabaglemo i ye ka dinan prisre, gun podo yenabuka. Kuno yegl mere, na ede okna wiga pre Jisas ugo, yoba ye meglmara eigwa i, na prisre, gun podo yeiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Jisas kagie ede mitna pi moran, na kagna ede atne enabuka pamiwe di, Jon yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Ana Jon ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Na makandigle yoba keme moglka pre na makandigle taragl plau dinabere i keme yoba di te moglka. Yegl erika ba yagl swara ta heven ibo moglsre, ede atne ugwa i, ye swara mogl mitna kaima edugo, yoba mudu mogl atne edimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Yene taragl ta pre kan erukwa i, yoba di pogl togwa ba yoba mere kide ye ka dugwa i ta pre mediglkrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Yoba mere ye ka dugwa i ta pre mediglkrikwa ba ira ta ye ka dugwa pre mediglkwa i, ye God kaima dumiwedi, i nogugl edime dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />God yagl ta dedugo, ugwa i, ye God kamo kuno ere dugwa. I siragl pre God ere mogl, ye Murubuglomo ye si kau si togo, ye Mudu Murubuglo nomane tomere kuno keme dumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />God Nem i, ye Wam dem muduo tedre, ye taragl mudu bitno morabedi togwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Yoba ta God Wam pre meduglkwa i, ye aimadi kamin kor morabuka i, i kodugwa. Ye i kodugwa ba yoba ta God Wam pre mediglkre, mane dugwa i, ye ta aimadi kamin kor moglkrabuka. God yoba i dem kubro tomiwe di, Jon yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ye Samaria abu bogl ka dibrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1-3" />Ana igne i yoba tau ere mogl, Farisi yoba di tedre, Yoba mere kide ye Jisas duglo beglko, Jisas ye yoba mere kide nigl bugl tome digwa. Yoba Jon duglo beglkwa i tau kuri meglko, Jisas duglo beglkwa i mere kide meglmiwe di, yegl digwa. Ye yegl digwa ba Jisas yene ta yoba nigl bugl tekrukwa. Ye duglo beglkwa yagl meglkwa i, ye yoba nigl bugl teigwa pre yoba yegl digwa. Ana yoba tau ye Farisi yoba ka yegl di teigo, prikwa i, Jisas pre kan eruko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl distrik Judia kide kodidre, ede ikne distrik Galili enamnedi eigwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:1-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Ye konbauna ede eimara i, ye ede distrik Samaria suna pidre, ede distrik Galili enaiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ye ede distrik Samaria suna pidre, ede taun ta Sikar we dimara eigwa. Taun Sikar i, yagl Jekop okna ibo ere mogl, dumo makan ta wam Josep tomara i, magigl yogwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Te, taun Sikar i meda kra, maugl nigl ta Jekop okna ibo wauglkwa i, nigl moglkwa. Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl i bogl konbauna ede u belo mere yegl dumo i wigo, ye konbauna eglke wigwa i pre Jisas toglabugl dugo, ye maugl nigl moglmara magigl i, ame di moglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7-8" />Ana Jisas ye maugl nigl moglmara magigl i, ame di moglko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i, Jisas kide kodo, ye ede pi taun Sikar suna pi, kaya mokna topo sinamnedi ede eigwa. Eigo, Jisas swara moglko, Samaria abu ta maugl nigl i mina nigl koragledi ugwa. Ugo, Jisas ye di te, Na nigl ta kogl naro, nenaluwe di, yegl dugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Woman at the well" file="lb00302b.tif" size="col" loc="4.7-8" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="4.7-8" /> <verse eid="JHN 4:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Yegl dugo, Samaria abu i di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Na Samaria abu moglko, ene Juda yagl motnga. Yegl pre ene siragl eruko, Na nigl kogl naro dine? di, yegl dugwa. Ye yegl dugwa i, i siragl pre Juda yoba ye Samaria yoba kide kaningwa pre ye akie moglkre, denbi dikre, erikwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Ana abu i ye Jisas yegl di pruko, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Na komono kana ene nigl kogl naro diga ba na erme ka ebrie ta dibo, pratnga. God ene siragl mere yoko kaima ere wakai ere tenagledi prukwa i, ene pre pogl sidre, te na ira moglka i, ene ta pre pogl sina, ene ere mogl, Na Nigl kogl naro di natngo. Te, ene yegl ta dina, na kaima nigl kor kogl ene teigo we di, Jisas ka ebrie yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Yegl dugo, abu i yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade, ene nigl kogl naratnga i, ene nigl migi ta yukitnga, te maugl nigl magigl i ama waugl ede atne kaima eigwa. Yegl pre ene nigl kor pre dinga i, aglo kogl naratne? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Maugl nigl magigl i, no neno Jekop waugl norukwa. Yene okna ibo maugl nigl i mina nigl kogl nedre, wama kogl tedre, agl bugla ta kuglkwa i ama kogl togwa. Ene pitnga i, ene mogl mitna ede, neno Jekop i egre atne ediedi pitno? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede tedre, Maugl nigl magigl i mina yoba ta kogl nenan, ye okuo aglke kor nigl gorabe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Yegl erabuka ba na nigl kogl, yoba ta tenaglka i, yoba ta nenan, ye okuo ege swara ta nigl goglkrabuka. Na nigl kogl tenaglka i, nigl ogo beimere yegl, ye moglmara suna i u pai moglsre, ye aimadi kamin kor morabuka i tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, Samaria abu i ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene nigl pre dinga i, kogl naro dugwa. Kogl natn, na nigl goglkre, nigl pre ege ege magigl wiga i, ta ukragle dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Dugo, Jisas di ikne ede tedre, Ene pi win agle din, akie wiro dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Akie wiro dugo, abu i di ikne ede tedre, Na wina ta moglkrume dugwa. Wina ta moglkrume dugo, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, Ka kaima diniwa. Ene win ta moglkrume dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Ene okna yagl 5-pela bage bage enga te, ene erme yagl ta bogl akie kipai miurka i ama ene win ta moglkrukwa. Ene kuno diniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, abu i aglke kor yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene ka kep yoba ta motnedi kanie dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Ka kep yoba ta motnga pre na ene ka kira ta poragledi prika. No kowano awano muglo meglbi magigl i mina God kagie kade teigwa ba ene Juda yoba meglkwa i, dumo Jerusalem swara i, yoba God kagie kade tenaiglkwa pamiwe di, yegl digwa. Ene Juda yoba kuno dimo mo no Samaria yoba kuno dumne? di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, okuo ene muglo meglbi i mo dumo Jerusalem mo dumo aglo mere ta God Nem kagie kade tenaiglkwa i, ene dumo i ta pre yubun dekraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Ene Samaria yoba i, ene God pre pogl sikre, kagie kade teigwa. No Juda yoba munga i, God pre pogl sidre, kagie kade tomga. I siragl pre God ye siragl mere yoba ere inagle dugwa i, ye no Juda yoba di noruko, prumga. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Yegl paugwa ba ege ta okuo plau dinabuka i mina ya erme pra, yoba kaima ta God Nem kagie kade tenamnedi praiglkwa i, ye muglo meglbi i mo dumo Jerusalem we di prikre, kiano mina God ka kaima kagie kade tenaiglmiwe dugwa. Yoba yegl mere praiglkwa i, Na Nina God ye yoba i na kagna kade naraiglmedi prukwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />God ye murubuglo moglkwa. Yegl pre yoba ta ye kagie kade tenaiglkwa i, ye kiano mina ka kaima kagie kade tenaiglkwa pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, abu i ere mogl, yegl dugwa, Na prika, God Kere Yugwa Yagl, Krais we digwa i, okuo unabuka. Ye unan, ka atne paugwa mudu di pogl norabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di ikne ede te, Na ene ka di te moglka i, na yagl dinga i moluwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Ana igne i Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ye taun suna kaya mokna topo si idre, ede ikne wigwa. Ede ikne u kanigwa, Jisas ye Samaria abu i bogl ka dibriko, kanigwa. Ye kandre, Samaria abu bogl ka dibredi wai kiglkwa ba ye abu i di prisre, Ene siragl pre une? dinaiglkwa mo Jisas di pre, Ene siragl pre abu i bogl ka dibre? dinaiglkwa i yubunde prikwa pre ka ta dikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Ana yagl wagle i ede ikne wigo, abu i ye nigl migimo kide kodidre, ede ikne taun suna pi, yoba taun suna meglkwa i di te, yegl dugwa, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />Yagl ta na mabuno siragl mere ta erika i, mudu di pogl nare kodugwa. Nono Krais unabiwe dumga ikra, yagl i ye moglmo mo ene kanaiglma wio! di, abu i yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Yegl dugo, yoba taun suna meglkwa i ye abu i sika sigo, akie taun kide kodo, ede pi Jisas moglmara eigwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ana abu i, Jisas moglmara kide kodo, ede taun suna ogwa igne i Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ere mogl, ye di te, Tisa, kaya mokna topo si yumga i, tau i no digwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas ye di ikne ede te, Na kaya mokna neiga, dana erukwa ba ene ta kankrimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ere mogl, yene di ikne ikne ede, Yoba ta kaya mokna yu Jisas togo, nomo mo? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yegl di meglko, Jisas kor di togwa, God na dedugwa i, na ye eratnedi prumere ersre, kogon dedumere ere kodinaglka i, na kaya mokna neiga, dana erukwa mere yegl paugwa pre diwe, di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Yoba ege mere digwa i, Kugl mogo sudiglsre, ba 4-pela sugl mogl, okuo mogo denan, si yunamga. Tabre ta si yukramne digwa. Yegl digwa ba ene prio. Ene gumuglno mina kaya togl kanibi, kugl mogo de kodumedi kanaiglmiwe, dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Te, yoba kugl mogo si yugwa i, makandigle topo imere mere yegl idre, aimadi kamin kor morabara pre kugl mogo ama si yugwa. Yegl pre kugl mogo suduglkwa yoba ya si yugwa yoba akie gun yenaiglkwa pame dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Yoba ka ta ama kugl mogo pre ege mere digwa i, yegl dime dugwa, Kogon yoba tau ede okna pidre, kugl mogo sudiglko, okuo kogon yoba pere tau u si yuime digwa. Ye digwa i, God kogonmo pre ama kuno erume dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />I siragl pre ene kugl mogo si yuigwa i, ene kogon podo ere, ere yaglkrikwa. Yoba pere pi kogon podo ersre, kugl mogo ere yaiglko, ene pi si yuio die dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Ana Samaria abu ikra ye yoba di te, Yagl ta na mabuno siragl mere ta erimere i, di nogugl ede nare kodume dugwa i, Samaria yoba tau mere ye taun suna kipai meglkwa i prisre, ye ka dumara i, Jisas pre mediglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Pre mediglkwa pre ye ede pi Jisas taun meda moglmara eigwa igne, ye Jisas di pre, ege tau akie mun, ene okuo ede enaiglmiwe digo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ege suo dumo i paigwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Ye ege suo dumo i paigwa pre Samaria yoba kor tau mere ama Jisas ka dugwa prisre, ye pre mediglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Te, yoba tau komono kana abu ikra ka dumara Jisas pre mediglkwa i ama Jisas ka dugwa i prisre, abu i di te, yegl digwa, No okna ene ka di notnga i prisre, Jisas pre medunga ba erme ene ka dinara swara i pre ta pre mediglkunga. No nono ama Jisas ka dugwa i prisre, pre pogl sumga. Yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ye ere inabuka yagl ka kaima moglmiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye yagl kade ta wam ere i kor edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ana Jisas ege suo dumo i padre, dumo i kide kodo ede distrik Galili suna ogwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />I siragl pre Jisas yene okna dugwa i, God kamo kep yoba ta morabuka i, ye yene dumomugl i keme yoba ye kagie kade tekraiglkwa ba dumo bage ta moraiglkwa i ye kagie kade tenaiglme dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Yegl pre Jisas prukwa i, Nasaret yoba na kana ta prikraiglkwa pamedi prukwa pre ye duglo beglkwa yoba bogl dumo Nasaret pikre, ede distrik Galili suna pi, dumo tau wan ede eigo, Galili yoba ye Jisas kogl kare di, di igwa. I siragl pre okna ege kade ta, God ye Israel yoba kowano awano oglo sumedi pre meglkwa igne i Galili yoba tau mere ede Jerusalem pidre, Jisas ye kimagl tau erukwa i, kanigwa pre erme ye di igwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46-47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46-47" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ye distrik Galili suna i, dumo kebra ta kagie Kana we digwa, okna Jisas nigl ere i wain edugwa dumo ikra eigwa. Eigo, yagl kade ta King Herot kogonmo ere togwa i, ye dumo Kaperneam mogl, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede dumo Kana wime digo, prukwa. Yagl i, ye wam kide si, goragledi erukwa. Yegl pre yoba Jisas distrik Judia kide kodo, ede Galili suna ume digo, prukwa igne, ye ede Kana pidre, Jisas di te, Na wana goragledi eruko, wiga. Nono ede ikne obugl, ene na wana ere i kor edinatnedi priwe, di, yegl di togwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:46-47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Di togo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene yoba magigl meglkwa i, na kimagl podo tau eribo, ene kandre keme na pre medraiglkwa paugwa. Ene ta kankribi, na ta pre mediglkraiglkwa pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Yegl dugo, yagl i aglke kor dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na wana gorabuka magigl erukwa. Ene tabre un, nono ede enabugle dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede tedre, Ene ede ikne po. Ene wan goglkre, kor morabiwe dugwa. Jisas yegl dugo, yagl i ye Jisas ka kaima dumedi pre mediglsre, ede ogwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ana yagl i ye ede ikne pi konbo bage padre, tagna ta konbauna ede pi moglko, ye niglmo kogonmo yoba tau pi bage tegigl yeidre, ye di teigwa, Ene wan aragan eruko, kor moglmiwe di, yegl di teigwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Di teigo, yagl i prisre, Aunake aragan erume? dugwa. Dugo, ye di ikne ede te, Eduedi, belo ikne mere yegl ye nagie niga dugwa i dudugo, aragan erume digwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Yegl digo, yagl i prisre, kina gudu pre ikne ede prukwa i, Jisas ye eduedi belo ikne mere yegl na di nare, Wan kor morabiwe di, yegl di narukwa. Ka kaima ye dumere kra pamiwedi, yegl di prukwa. Yegl pre yagl i ya yoba ye kipamara akie paigwa i, mudu Jisas pre mediglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Jisas ye distrik Judia kide kodidre, distrik Galili u kimagl yegl ta erukwa i, ye distrik Galili suna kimagl okna swara ta ersre, erme ege suo kimagl erukwa.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Nigl nubun Betesda bina Jisas yagl ta kide sugwa ere wakai erukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Okuo, Juda yoba kaya mokna podo ta nenaiglkwa ege ta yogo, Jisas ege i ede Jerusalem ogwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Dumo Jerusalem i, kobuglo togl ere winabo dimara, togl dra ta yogwa, kagie Sipsip Togl Dra we digwa. Togl dra yomara magigl i, nigl nubun ta waiglkwa moglkwa. Nigl nubun i, ka Hibru mina kagie Betesda we digo, nigl nubun bina yugu teka 5-pela si winabo digo, yeigwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3-4" />Ana yugu teka si yeimara i, yoba kide sugwa ya gumuglno kin yogwa mo ogono kaglno kide erukwa mo mawa sugwa i, mere kide yugugl i pai meglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Ana nigl nubun Betesda moglmara i, yagl ta bugla yugu 38-pela kide sugwa igle pai moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Pai moglko, Jisas wan u kanugwa. Kandre, yagl i kamun kuade kide sumedi pre kan ersre, ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Kidenen aragan erabedi pitno? dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Di pruko, yagl kide sugwa i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na kidena aragan erabuka ba na kabaglena ta moglsre, na auro i pi nigle edenabuka i ta moglkrukwa pre nigl magigl i si tobuno yake make togwa igine, na ede nigl atne enagledi eriba yoba pere ege ege ede okna pidre, ede nigl atne eimiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di tedre, Ene adigl, kuguglnen ake idre, konbauna ede po! dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Dugo, yagl i oglade aragan eruko, ye kugugl mina pai moglkwa ikra ake idre, adigl ede ogwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Ana ege i wakan kade ege yogwa <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />pre Juda yoba kade yagl i kandre, di te, Erme wakan kade ege yogwa. Ene kuguglnen ake konbauna wanga i, lo si biglke diniwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Yegl digwa ba yagl i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na kide na sugo, yagl ta na ere wakai ere narukwa i, ye na di nare, Kuguglnen ake idre, konbauna ede po dugo, na ye dumere keme erie dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Dugo, Juda yoba kade i ye di pre, Ira ene yegl di tome? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Ye yegl di prikwa ba yagl i ira ye ere wakai ere togwa i pre kan erekrukwa. I siragl pre Jisas ye ere wakai ere togwa igne, yoba mere kide magigl magigl meglko, Jisas ye ere wakai ere tedre, tabre kana ye kide kodo, yoba mere meglmara ede suna pi ede ogwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Ana okuo yagl kide sugwa i ye tawa teigwa yugu togl suna moglko, Jisas ye kandre, ye moglmara pi, ye yegl di togwa, Ene pro! Kide ene okna sugwa i, na ere wakai ere teigo, ene aragan erukwa. Ba ene tadaglme ere motnga i kide kodo. Ene ere pai motn, kide ene okna sugwa i taragl kebra pamedi pratnga. Ba ene motnara yubun ta okuo plau dinabuka i, podo kaima panabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Yegl dugo, yagl i ere mogl, yagl ta na ere wakai ere narukwa i, Jisas moglkwa pamiwedi prisre, ye ede pi Juda yoba kade ikra meglmara di pogl togwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Ana Jisas yagl kide sugwa ere wakai ere togwa i, wakan kade ege erukwa pre Juda yoba kade meglkwa i, kide prisre, Jisas kenaglmo si, ye di kide yei meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Di kide yei meglko, Jisas prisre, ye meglmara u ye yegl di togwa, Na Nina moglkwa i, ye kogon ege ege ersre, ede u erme pra, kogon ere moglkwa. Te, na moglka i, ama ege ege kogon ere moluwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Yegl dugwa pre Juda yoba kade ye kide kaima pre, Jisas si goramnedi prikwa. I siragl pre ye prikwa i, ye wakan kade ege yagl ta ere wakai ere togwa i, ye lo mane dumara kogon erumedi prisre, lo si biglke dumedi prikwa. Te, Jisas ye God kagie daglsre, Na Nina we dugwa i, ye God bogl kuno kaima muluwe dugwa pre Juda yoba kade ama kide pre, ye si goramnedi prikwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas kagie kade paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Ana Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, na God Wam moglka i, na nana primere kogon eribo, i kuno ta erekrabuka. Na Nina kogon siragl mere erukwa i, na kandre, ye erumere keme erika. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />I siragl pre na Nina na dem muduo narsre, kogon erumere mudu obuno di narukwa. Te, okuo Na Nina ere mogl, ene nagino koraiglmedi na kogon podo tau eratnedi obuno di naran, na eraluwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na Nina ye yoba geglkwa i, ere i kor edumere yegl, na ye Wam moglka i, nana primere yoba kor moraiglkwa i, teiga. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Te, Na Nina moglkwa i, ye yoba kotno prisre, pre yubu si, yegl ta erekrukwa. I siragl pre na ye Wam moglka i, kogon yegl mere nare kodugwa pre nana yoba mudu kotno prisre, pre yubu sinaglka. <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />Na Nina kogon yegl mere narukwa i, yoba ye kagie kade teimere yegl, na ama kagna kade naraiglmedi pre kogon yegl narukwa. Yoba ta na kagna kade narekran, ye God na dedugwa i ama kagie kade tekrumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Jisas ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Yoba ta na kana prisre, God na dedugwa i kaima dumedi pre meduglkwa i, ye aimadi kamin kor morabuka i, i kodugwa. Ye geglkwa yugobunomo kide kodidre, ede pi kor meglkwa yugobunomo i mina pi kodugwa. Te, God ye okuo yoba ka tage tenabuka i, ye yoba i ta ka tage tekrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Ege okuo ta unan, Na God Wam moglka i, ka ta dibo, yoba geglkwa i prisre, adigl u kor enaiglkwa. Te, erme pra, yoba geglkwa tau ama na kana prisre, adigl u kor pi kodigwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />I siragl pre Na Nina ye kor meglkwa mabuno moglmere yegl, ye na kor meglkwa mabuno nare kodugwa pre yoba kor aimadi moraiglkwa mabuno i, na moglka.<verse eid="JHN 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i pre God na yoba mudu kotno pratnedi kagna kade nare kodugwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28-29" />Na erme ka diga i, ene prisre, nagino koglkrio! I siragl pre ege okuo ta unan, na Yoba Wam moglka i ka ta dibo, yoba geglkwa i mudu prisre, adigl u kor enaiglkwa. Ye adigl u kor enaiglkwa i, yoba wakai ta erikwa i, aimadi kamin kor meglbi, kide ta erikwa i ka tage inaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:28-29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ira moglkwa i, nogugl paugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na nana primere kogon ta eraglka i, kuno ta erekrukwa. God prumere i keme erika. Te, na taragl kane kane pre yubu siga i, God na di narumere keme pre yubu siga. Na nana primere kogon ta erekrika ba God na dedugwa i keme prumere erika pre na taragl kane kane kuno keme pre yubu siwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Ana na ira moglka i, nana swara keme ene di pogl tebo, ene na kibi dumedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Yegl praiglkwa ba na nana swara keme ene di pogl tekrika. Yoba ta ama na ira moglka i, ene di pogl te moglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisas ye yoba swara pre dugwa i, God Nem pre dugwa paugwa.</char></note> Te, na prika i, ye na pre dugwa i, ka kaima keme dumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Ana Jisas ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ira moglka i, yagl Jon ama ene di pogl togwa. Ene yoba tau ye Jon kira pogl praiglmedi dedigo, ye pi, kira peglko, Jon na pre ka kaima di ikne edugwa igne i pre diga. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Yoba ka siragl mere na pre digwa i na ta pre yubun dekrika ba na erme Jon ka yegl dume diga i, God ene ere inabedi prisre, ene praiglmedi ene yegl di teiga. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Jon moglkwa i, ye ken abuglage mere yegl sugo, ene ege sugunagle ye kamo prisre, gun yeigwa ba okuo ene ye kamo kide kodimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Jon ye na pre dugwa i, kaima dugwa ba taragl swara ta ye dugwa i, win si togwa. Na diga i, na kogon siragl mere erika i pre diga. Na Nina yene kogon tau na ere kodinatnedi naruko, na ere moglka pre na kogon ere wiga i ene kandre, God na dedugo, umedi kanaiglkwa i, nogugl paugwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Te, na ira moglka i, Na Nina na dedugwa i, ye ama ene di pogl togwa. Ene di pogl togwa ba ene ye ka dugwa prikre, ye siragl mere moglkwa i kankre, erimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Te, God kamo ene deno muduno mina paikrukwa i, nogugl paugwa. I siragl pre ye na dedugo, wiga ba ene na ta pre mediglkrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Ene God kamo pre pogl sinamnedi kere moglsre, kerimara i mina ene wakai munedi prisre, aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa i, ene i kodumnedi prikwa ba God kamo i, na ira moglka i, i nogugl edugwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Yegl pre ene God kamo kersre, na moglmara u aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa i, ibi, kuno erukwa ba ene na moglmara unaiglkwa i, enene mane dimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta kagna kade naraiglkwa mo narekraiglkwa mo i, na pre yubun dekrika. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42-44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42-44" />Ba ene siragl mere meglkwa i, na kan pogl siga. Ene deno muduno God tekre, yoba kagno kade noraiglmedi prikwa. Ene God deno muduno tekrikwa i, nogugl paugwa. I siragl pre na Nina kagie mina wiga ba ene na di ikrikwa. Ene na di ikrikwa ba yoba ta yene kagie mina unan, ene yoba i di inaiglkwa. Te, ene yoba kagno kade noraiglmedi prisre, God swara kaima moglkwa i, no wakai erume dinabuka mo dikrabuka i, ene pre yubun dekrikwa. Ene yegl mere meglkwa pre ene na pre medraiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:42-44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Jisas yegl didre, ka swara ta ama yegl dugwa, Na Nina gumuglo mina adigl moglsre, ene kot ere tekraglka. Ene na yegl erabedi prikrio. I siragl pre yoba swara ta God gumuglo adigl moglsre, ene kot ere tenabuka i, Moses yegl erabuka. Moses ka bogl atne edugwa i, ene duglo boglsre, aimadi kamun moramnedi prikwa ba i ta kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Moses ye na pre dugwa pre ene ye kamo pre mediglma, ene na ama pre mediglko. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ba ene Moses ka boglkwa i ta pre mediglkrikwa. Yegl pre ene na kana pre medraiglkwa i ama kuno ta erekrumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ye bret ya buglo bagle ake buko didre, yoba 5,000 mere yegl togwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matyu 14.13-21</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mak 6.30-44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Feeding 5.000" file="FM 162 Feeding 5000_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="6.1" />Okuo Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl nigl nubun Galili we dimara ede koglo ibo eigwa. Nigl nubun i, kagie ta Taiberias we digwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Ye ede koglo ibo eigo, yoba mere kide Jisas ye okna kimagl ere, yoba kide sigwa ake kun eruko, kanigwa pre ye ama Jisas omara mokomugl sika si ede eigwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Sika si ede eigo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede muglo ibo pi, ame di meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Igne i, Juda yoba ere mogl, God okna Israel yoba oglo si pidre, Isip yoba wano komono si goglkwa ikra pre moraiglkwa egemo magigl ugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ame di meglko, Jisas kan atne ede, yoba mere kide ye moglmara wigo, kanugwa. Jisas kandre, ye duglo boglkwa yagl Filip di pre, Nono aglo mere bret topo sumun, yoba mudu nenaiglme? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Jisas siragl mere erabuka i, ye pre kan ere kodugwa ba ye Filip siragl mere di ikne edenan, pragledi yegl di prukwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di pruko, Filip di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba mere kide meglkwa pre nono mige silva 200 mere ta i pi bret topo sumun, yoba bret i kunabe kunabedi tomun nenaiglkwa ba yoba ikne mudu yoko moraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Filip yegl dugo, Andru, ye Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta Saimon Pita agigle moglkwa i, ere mogl, Jisas yegl di togwa, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />Yagl gak ta magigl moglkwa i, ye bret kugl mogo bali mina gaiglkwa i, 5-pela idre, buglo bagle suo ama yugwa ba yoba mere kide meglkwa pre taragl kebra yegl nenaiglkwa ta kuno erekrabiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Andru yegl dugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl wagle i di te, Ene yoba mudu di tebi, ame dinaiglmiwe dugwa. Dumo i kugl podo bogl moglmara yogwa. Ana Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i yoba di teigo, ye mudu ame digwa. Yoba ame digwa i mere kide meglkwa. Gak abu kerekrikwa ba yagl kerikwa i, 5,000 mere yegl meglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Ana yoba ame di kodigo, Jisas bret akidre, God di wakai yei te, bret yubu si, yoba ame digwa i, mudu togo, ye ta nenamnedi primere i neigwa. Te, Jisas buglo bagle ama idre, kuno yegl erukwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Yegl eruko, yoba mudu neigwa dano eruko, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Bret ikne tau yoko yogwa i, kide ere dinabiwe dugwa. Ene gade idre, degigl gagl mina grio dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Jisas yegl dugo, yoba bret 5-pela ikra wagle pra neigo, ikne tau yoko yogwa i, ye gade idre, degigl gagl 12-pela gre kau sigwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Ana Jisas bret ya buglo bagle idre, kimagl erukwa i, yoba kandre, yegl digwa, Yoba okna Ka Kep Yagl ta unabe digwa i we, ye ka kaima umiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yegl digo, Jisas prukwa i, Ye na king moratnedi na gudu i ede enaiglkrawa we di prisre, ye aglke kor yoba kide kodo, ye swara ede muglo ibo ogwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas nigl yaudomugl konbauna ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matyu 14.22-33</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mak 6.45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Ana okuo min panagledi eruko, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl wagle i, ede nigle bina eigwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Pi sugl meglko, mim eruko, Jisas ye ikne ukrukwa pre yene ede baglkugl kuglo pi mogl, nigl koglo ibo, dumo Kaperneam enamnedi ede eigwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Ye nigle ede eigo, ir podo ugo, nigl si pepigl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Nigl si pepigl dugo, ye buglo aware si, 5 mo 6 kilomita mere yegl eigo, Jisas nigl yaudomugl konbauna u, ye baglkugl wagle meglmara magigl ugo, kanigwa. Kandre, kudugl geglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Kudugl geglkwa ba Jisas ere mogl, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na wiga. Ene kudugl goglkrio! dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Yegl dugo, ye Ede baglkugl kuglo wo! digo, ye ede kuglo ogwa. Ye ede kuglo baglkugl mina ogo, baglkugl oglade ye dumo ta enamnedi eimara pi nigle bina pai moglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba Jisas dokigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ana tagugo i, yoba koglo ibo mogl pai mogl, Jisas ikne unan, kanamnedi sugl meglkwa. Ye eduedi kanigwa i, baglkugl swara keme yogo, Jisas baglkugl wagle pikruko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl keme ede baglkugl kuglo pi mogl, ede eigo, kanigwa pre ye koglo ya moglmedi pre, sugl meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Ye sugl mogl, Jisas kankriko, yoba tau baglkugl mina dumo Taiberias kide kodo, ede u Yagl Kade Jisas eduedi God di wakai yei tedre, bret yubu si togo, yoba bret neimara ikra magigl i wigwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Wigo, yoba mere kide meglkwa i Jisas ya ye duglo beglkwa yagl mudu moglkriko, kandre, ye baglkugl tau wigwa i wagle kuglo pi mogl, Jisas kanamnedi ede koglo ibo pi dumo Kaperneam eigwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas bret ta kor moraiglkwa togwa i, Na moluwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ana yoba mere kide ede dumo Kaperneam eigo, Jisas moglko, kanigwa. Kandre, ye yegl di prikwa, Tisa yo, ene aunake une? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Digo, Jisas di ikne ede, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, ene na dokigwa i, na kimagl eriko, ene kandre, nomane igwa pre na dokokrikwa. Ene bret neigwa, dano erukwa swara i pre na dokigwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Ene kaya mokna yoko makandigle dokigwa i, bugl kide erabuka. Ene kaya mokna i dokokre, kaya mokna ta ene nedre, aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa i dokio! dugwa. Na Yoba Wam moglka i, kaya mokna yegl, ene tenaglka. Nina Kade God na yegl eratnedi kere yugo, na wiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, yoba ere mogl, ye yegl di prikwa, God kogonmo no ta eraiglmedi prukwa i, siragl kogon eramne? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene God kogonmo eraiglkwa i, yegl paugwa, God na dedugo, wiga i, ene na pre medraiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, yoba aglke kor digwa, Ene kimagl siragl mere etn, no kandre, ene pre medramne? digwa. Ene siragl eratne? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Nono kowano awano dumo wau yomara meglkwa igne, ye bret ta mana we digwa i neigwa. I pre God kamo wagle yegl beglkwa, Bret ta heven ibo yei, ede atne ugwa i, ye yoba nenaiglmedi tome<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 16.4, Nehemia 9.15, Giglage 78.24-25</char></note> digwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, bret heven ibo yei, ede atne ugwa i, ene prikwa, Moses ye kowano awano tomedi prikwa ba i ta manugwa. God yene togwa. Te, erme we, Na Nina bret ta ka kaima heven ibo yei, ede atne ugwa i, ene togwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />God bret ene togwa i, heven ibo yei, ede atne udre, yoba mudu kor moraiglkwa tomiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, yoba ye di te, yegl digwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene bret i ege ege noro! digwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yegl digo, Jisas aglke kor dugwa, Bret ta kor moraiglkwa togwa i, na moglka. Yoba ta na moglmara udre, na pre mediglbi, ye ege swara ta kidan goglkre, nigl goglkre, yegl eraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Jisas ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene di te kodiga. Ene na kanigwa ba ene na ta pre mediglkrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Na Nina yoba ira ta ogona mina edugwa i, ye mudu na moglmara unaiglkwa. Te, yoba ira ta na moglmara unaiglkwa i, na ka kaima ye swara ta si meda edekraglka. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />I siragl pre na heven ibo mogl, ede atne wiga i, na nana primere eragledi ukrika ba na Nina, na dedugwa i, prumere keme eragledi wiga. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Na Nina prukwa i, yegl prukwa, ye yoba mudu ta ogona mina edugwa i, na swara kaima ta kide kodokratnedi prisre, ege okuo ta unabuka i, ye mudu kaima ogono nagino ere i kor ede tenatnedi prukwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na Nina prukwa i, ama yegl prukwa, Na ye Wam moglka i, yoba ira ta na kandre, na pre medrabuka i, aimadi kamin kor morabedi prukwa. Te, ege okuo ta unabuka i, na yoba i ogono nagino ere i kor edinatnedi prumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ana Jisas ye bret ta heven ibo yei, ede atne ugwa i, na mole dugwa i pre Juda yoba kade pre meglkwa i kide prisre, ka kane kane digwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Ye ka kane kane didre, ama di ikne ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yagl i, kagie Jisas, nem Josep kra. Ye nem mam kamgrawa, ye siragl mere heven ibo mogl, ede atne ugwa pre dume? digwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Juda yoba kade ka yegl di ikne ikne ede meglko, Jisas ere mogl, Ene ka kane kane di ikne ikne edigwa i, kide kodio! dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Yoba ta yene primere na moglmara unaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa. Na Nina na dedugwa i, ye swara yoba ta auro yunan, unaiglkwa. Te, yoba ta na moglmara unaiglkwa i, na ege okuo ye ogono nagino ere i kor ede tenaglka. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />God kamo kep yagl ta okna moglkwa i, yegl boglkwa, God ye yoba mudu nomane tenabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 54.13</char></note> di, yegl boglkwa. Ye boglmere yegl, na Nina kaima yoba nomane te moglko, yoba ira ta prisre, nomane igwa i, ye mudu na moglmara wimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta na Nina kankrikwa ba na ye dedugo, wiga i, na swara God kanie dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Yoba ira ta na pre meduglkwa i, ye aimadi kamin kor morabuka i, i kodugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />I siragl pre bret ta yoba nedre, kor moraiglkwa i, na moglka. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Ene kowano awano dumo wau yomara wan meglkwa igne, ye bret ta mana we digwa i neigwa ba ye okuo geglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Yegl erikwa ba bret ta heven ibo yei, ede atne ume diga i, yoba bret i ta nenan, ye ta goglkrabuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Bret ta kor moglsre, heven ibo yei, ede atne ugwa i, na moglka. Yoba bret i nenan, ye aimadi kamin kor morabuka. Na bret we diga i, nana ogona nagna pre diga. Yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i kor moraiglmedi, ogona nagna tenaluwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, Juda yoba pre meglkwa i ere mogl, ka kane kane di ikne ikne edidre, ama yegl digwa, Yagl i siragl mere ogo nagie noran, nenamga pre dume? digwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Juda yoba yegl digo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, ene na ogona nagna nedre, bormaina nedre keme kor moraiglkwa. Ta manan, ene kor moglkraiglkwa i ta ikraiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Yoba ta na ogona nagna ya bormaina nogwa i, ye aimadi kamin kor morabuka i, i kodugwa. Te, ege okuo yenabuka igne, na ye ogo nagie ere i kor edenaglka. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />I siragl pre na ogona nagna i, kaya mokna kaima mere yegl yogwa. Te, na bormaina i, nigl kaima nenaiglkwa mere yegl moglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta na ogona nagna ya bormaina neigwa i, ye ede u na moglmara atne kra pai meglko, na ye deno muduno suna ama pai moglka. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Na Nina kor aimadi moglsre, na dedugwa i, ye na kor moratnedi narukwa. Kuno yegl mere yoba ta na ogona nagna ya bormaina nenabuka i, na ye kor morabedi tebo, kor aimadi morabuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Bret ta heven ibo yei, ede atne ugwa i, na mole diga. Ene kowano awano okna ibo dumo wau yomara mogl, bret ta mana we digwa i nedre, okuo geglkwa. Ba na bret ta heven ibo yei, ede atne ume diga i, yoba bret i ta nenabuka yobamo i, kor aimadi morabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Jisas ka yegl dugwa i, ye dumo Kaperneam, ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara yugugl mogl, yoba ka beke te moglsre, ka yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugwa pre ye duglo beglkwa yoba tau mere ka i prisre, yegl digwa, Jisas ka yegl dugwa i, waragne paugwa. Nono pre inamga i, kuno ta erekrumiwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas ye digwa i pre kan ersre, ye yegl di togwa, Na ka diga i, ene kide pre, mane dinaiglmo? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Na ka diga i, ene waragne pamedi pribi, ene okuo kan meglbi, na Yoba Wam moglka i ede kuglo pi okna heven ibo moglmara ebo, ene siragl mere praiglme? dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta yene yobuglno mina aimadi kamin kor moglkraiglkwa ba God Murubuglomo swara ye kor moraiglmedi eran, moraiglkwa. Te, na kana ene di teiga i swara mina God Murubuglo ene kor moraiglmedi tenabuka. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Yegl paugwa ba ene tau na ta pre mediglkrime dugwa. Jisas yegl dugwa i, i siragl pre ye duglo beglkwa yoba ira ta ye pre mediglkrikwa ya yagl swara ta okuo ye i pi kuda ikne ogono mina yenabuka i, ye komono kana pre kan ere kodugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene tau na pre mediglkrikwa i pre na ene di te kodiga, God yoba ta unabedi eran keme yoba i na moglmara unabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Ana Jisas ye ogo nagie ya bormaimo i, yoba nenaiglme dugwa igne i ye duglo beglkwa yoba tau mere ye omara sika sikre, ye kide kodigwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yegl erikwa pre Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela ama di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene ama na kide kodinamnedi primo? dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Jisas yegl di pruko, Saimon Pita di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, no ene kide kodidre, yoba ira moglmara enamne? Yoba aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa ka i, ene swara no di notnga. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Te, God ye ene swara i pere edugo, uniwedi no yegl pre mediglsre, pre pogl sumniwe di, Pita yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Ana Pita yegl di kodugo, Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na swara ene yagl 12-pela kere iga ba ene meglmara suna i, yagl swara ta Satan gagigle ta moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Jisas yegl dugwa i, yagl ta kagie Judas, Saimon Iskariot wam moglkwa i pre dugwa. Ye yegl dugwa i siragl pre Judas i, okuo Jisas i pi kudamo ikne ogono mina yenabuka pre dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Ege kade ta yogo, Jisas ede Jerusalem ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Mokomugl i, Jisas distrik Judia enakiure, distrik Galili suna i keme wan moglkwa. I siragl pre Juda yoba kade dumo Judia suna meglkwa i, ye si goramnedi prikwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Wan moglko, Juda yoba egeno kade ta ede magigl ugwa. Ege kade i, Yugu Teka Sigwa ege yome digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Ede magigl ugwa pre Jisas agiglema Jisas di te, Igle kide kodo ede distrik Judia po! Kimagl magigl etnere ibo etn, ene duglo beglkwa yoba tau mere kanaiglma. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Yoba kagno kade inamnedi prikwa i, kogon teke atne erekrikwa. Nogugl erikwa. Yegl pre ene taragl kade eratnga kuno panan, yoba mudu kanaiglmedi dumo Judia i ero di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Jisas agiglema ama ye pre mediglkrikwa pre ka yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Digo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Na ede Jerusalem enaglka ege i, erme ta yeikrukwa. Ba ene erme enaiglkwa mo okuo enaiglkwa i, kuno keme yogwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Makandigle yoba na deno kubro narikwa ba ene ta tekraiglkwa. I siragl pre ye mabuno kide erikwa di pogl teiga. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Enene ede ege kade pi kanio! Na enaglka i, egena ta yeikrukwa pre na erme ta pikraluwe di, <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Jisas ye agiglema yegl di tedre, distrik Galili suna pai moglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Pai moglkwa ba Jisas agiglema ede ege kade eigo, Jisas ama mokonomugl ede ogwa. Ye ogwa i, nogugl yoba gumuglno mina pikrukwa ba yoba ye kan dinaiglmedi atne konbo mere yegl ede ogwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Ana Juda yoba kade Jerusalem meglkwa i, ye yoba makai simara suna i Jisas dokidre, Ye umo mo di, yoba kira pogl pre wan meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Yegl eriko, te yoba ege kade yomedi ede Jerusalem pi, makai sigwa i, ye Jisas pre ka kane kane di ikne ikne edigwa. Tau digwa i, Ye yagl wakai moglmiwe digo, yoba tau digwa i, Ta manugwa, ye yoba ki bakagl tedre, ka kibi di tedre, yegl erukwa yagle moglmiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Yoba meglmara suna i, ka yegl di ikne ikne edigwa ba ye Juda yoba kade kuduglno gogl teigwa pre ye Jisas kagie nogugl daglkre, ka atne keme digwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Ana Juda yoba egeno kade i, ikne dudugo, ikne pai moglko, Jisas ede tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna pidre, God kamo yoba beke togwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Beke te moglko, Juda yoba kade pre moglsre, nagino kogl, yegl digwa, Yagl i, ye skul kade ta dikrukwa pre ye nomane podo i, siragl mere idre, ka yegl dume? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Digo, Jisas prisre, di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Na yoba ka beke teiga i, na nana primere ta beke tekrika ba God na dedugwa i, yene prumere keme yoba ka beke te moluwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Na ka diga i, God kamo idre dio mo na nana primere keme dio mo i, God prumere eragledi prabuka yobamo i, ye pre pogl sinabuka. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Te, ene prio. Yoba ta yene prumere ka beke tenabuka i, ye yene kagie kade inagledi prukwa. Ba na yoba ka beke teiga i, God na dedugwa i, swara kagie kade inabedi pre erika. Yegl pre na ka kibi dikre, ka kaima keme diwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Moses ene God lomo togwa ba ene mudu kaima ta lo duglo boglkrikwa. God lomo Yoba si goglkrio di, mane dumara i, ene siragl pre na si goramnedi erime? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Yegl dugo, yoba Jisas kamo pre meglkwa i, ye di ikne ede te, yegl digwa, Yoba ira ene si goramnedi erikwa pre dine? Murubuglo kide ta ene motnara suna moglko, ene du etnga pamiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Digo, Jisas aglke kor ye yegl di togwa, Na wakan kade igne, kimagl swara ta erika pre ene mudu nomane podo sigwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Ba ene prio! Moses ene di togwa i, ene yagl gak ta kuraiglkwa, ege 8-pela de ta morabuka igne i, ene ye gagie puduo gagie boraiglkwa pamiwe dugwa. Ka i, Moses komono kana ta dikrukwa ba ene kowano awano okna yegl digwa paugo, okuo Moses ama yegl dugwa. Moses yegl dugwa i pre ene wakan kade igne kogon ersre, yagl gak nagino puduo nagie beglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Ene God lomo swara, Moses bogl atne edugwa i si biglke di dinamniwedi wakan kade igne kogon ta erse, yagl gak gagno puduo gagie bogl teigwa ba na wakan kade igne yagl ta ogo nagie mudu ere wakai ere teimara i, ene siragl pre na deno kubro narime? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Na kogon erika i, ene enene primere kan yubu sigwa i, kodo, mabuno kaima pamara ime kandre, yubu sio! di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba ye Jisas ira moglkwa i pre ka drano digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Ana yoba dumo Jerusalem kipaigwa i tau Jisas ka dugwa i prisre, yegl digwa, Yagl Jisas i, yoba kade tau ye si goramnedi konbo dokigwa <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />ba ene kanio! Jisas ye nogugl ka di moglmiba yoba kade wagle i, ye ka dugwa i ta si kegl dikre, kanige erikwa. Yoba kade i nomane kor ta idre, Jisas ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglmedi primo mo? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Yegl didre, ama yegl digwa, Ba nono prumga i, yagl Jisas, ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl morabuka i, kuno ta erekrukwa. I siragl pre yoba digwa i, Krais unabuka igne, ye aglo mere unabuka i, yoba ta kankraiglme digwa ba yagl Jisas i, ye aglo mere mogl, ugwa i, nono prumga pre ye Krais ta moglkrumiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Ana yoba ka yegl digo, Jisas ye tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna moglsre, yoba ka beke tomara suna i ka podo didre, yegl dugwa, Na siragl mere moglka i ya aglo mere wiga i, ene pre kan erumniwedi prikwa. Ba na wiga i, nana primere ta ukrika. Na Nina mabuno kaima keme erukwa i, na dedugo, wiga ba ene ye ta pre kan erekrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Pre kan erekrikwa ba na moglka i, na Nina pre kan erika. I siragl pre na ye bogl akie muglko, ye na dedugo, wiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugwa pre yoba kide prisre, ye si akenamnedi erikwa ba i ta manugwa. Jisas gorabuka egemo i ta yeikrukwa pre yoba ye si akenamnedi erikwa i, kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Yoba tau yegl erikwa ba tau mere ama ye pre mediglsre, yegl digwa, Krais unabe digwa i, Jisas kimagl podo podo erumere mere egre tenabo? digwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawa teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba kibr nem Jisas si kane si wio digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Ana yoba ka yegl mere atne kra di iborya di meglko, yoba tau ka waie ere, Farisi yoba di teigwa. Di teigo, Farisi yoba yeigo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i bogl ye prisre, kibr nem tau dede, Ene pi Jisas si kane si yunaiglmiwe di, dedigwa. Dedigo, ye ede eigwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Ana Jisas ye dedigwa prisre, ka yegl dugwa, Na ege sugunagle keme ene bogl akie moramga. Mun, okuo na ede ikne pi, Nina na dedugwa i moglmara ede enaglka. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Ede ebo, ene na dokinaiglkwa ba na ta kankraiglkwa. Te, na enaglmara i, ene ta enaiglkwa i ama kuno ta erekrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35-36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35-36" />Jisas yegl dugwa pre Juda yoba ye kamo pre meglkwa i kinano yogo, ye ere mogl, yene di ikne ikne ede pre, yegl digwa, Yagl i ka didre, Ene na dokinaiglkwa ba na ta kankraiglme dugwa i ya Na enaglmara i, ene ta enaiglkwa kuno ta erekrabe dugwa i, siragl pre dume? digwa. Ye ede aglo ena pre dume? Grik yoba meglmara Juda yoba tau swarade pi suna suna meglmara i, ye pidre, ye ka beke te, Grik yoba meglkwa i ama ka beke tenabuka pre dumo mo? di, yoba i yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:35-36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye yoba nigl kor tenagle dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Ana Juda yoba egeno kade dudunabuka magigl eruko, ye ege swara kaima makai si moglsre, tagana ede pere pere enaiglkwa ege i, ege kade kaima yogwa. Ege i Jisas yoba makai si meglmara suna adigl moglsre, ye ka podo di, yegl dugwa, Yoba ta nigl goran, ye ede u na moglmara udre, nigl kor nenabuka paugwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />God kamo dumere mere, yoba ta na pre medrabuka i, dem muduo mina nigl ogo mere yegl bogl pai mogl, kau sinan, nigl mere kide pepigl di ede meda enabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Ana Jisas nigl kor pre dugwa i, pre mediglkwa yoba okuo Mudu Murubuglo inaiglkwa pre dugwa. Igne i, Jisas ede ikne heven ibo pidre, abuglagemo podo sumara moglkrukwa pre ye Mudu Murubuglo ikrikwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba tau Jisas pre mediglko, tau pre mediglkrikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Jisas yegl dugwa pre yoba tau mere ka yegl digwa, Yagl i, ye Ka Kep Yagl ta unabe digwa ikra kaima moglkwa pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Te tau ama, Ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglmiwe digwa. Yegl digwa ba yoba tau yegl digwa, Krais unabuka i, distrik Galili nem ta moglkrabuka. <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />God kamo dugwa i, Krais ye Devit gawamo ta moglsre, dumo Betlehem, Devit okna moglmara i mina unabe dugwa pre ye ta manumiwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Yoba ka kane kane yegl didre, Jisas ira moglkwa i pre nomano swara yeikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Te, yoba tau Jisas si akenamnedi prikwa ba yoba swara ta si akekrukwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba kade ye Jisas pre mediglkrikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Ana kibr nem ede ikne pi tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya Farisi yoba meglmara eigo, ye ka tedre, Ene siragl pre yagl i si kane sikre, yoko ede ikne wime? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Digo, kibr nem di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Okna ede u erme i, yoba swara ta yagl i ka dumere ta dikrime digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Yegl digo, Farisi yoba aglke kor digwa, Ene ama kinano sugo, ye pre mediglkwa pame digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />No yoba kade ya Farisi yoba munga i, swara ta ye pre mediglkwa ta kanimo? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ba yoba mere kide ye kamo pre meglkwa i, God lomo pre pogl sikre, du erikwa. Yoba i God ere kide ere tenabiwe digwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Yegl digo, Farisi yagl swarano ta Nikodemus, ye okna Jisas moglmara eduer ogwa yagl ikra, ye yegl dugwa, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />Nono lono dugwa i, yoba yene ta udre, dra mina ka ta dinan, nono prisre, pre yubu sumun, kuno erabe dugwa. Yene ta u dikran, nono ta pre yubu sikramga pamiwe di, Nikodemus yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Yegl dugo, Farisi yoba tau di ikne edidre, yegl digwa, Ene ama Galili nem ta motnkana digwa. Enene God kamo kere pitn, pre pogl sinatnga. Distrik Galili suna i, God kamo kep yoba ege swara ta plau dikrabiwe di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Yegl digo, ye mudu ede pere pere pidre, ede kipaimara eigwa.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Abu ta yagl ta bogl kunogl nebrika i, Farisi yoba yu Jisas moglmara edigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ana yoba ede pere pere eigwa igne, Jisas ede muglo Oliv we dimara pi padre, <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Tagna kana aglke kor ede tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna ugo, yoba mere kide ye moglmara wigwa. Wigo, Jisas ame di moglsre, ye ka beke te moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Beke te moglko, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba tau ere mogl, abu ta mabuno kide erukwa i, auro yuigwa. Abu i, yagl ta bogl kunogl nebriko, yoba tau kanigo, ye auro yu yoba gumuglnomugl edidre, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Jisas yegl di teigwa, Tisa yo, Abu i, yagl ta bogl kunogl nebriko, yoba tau kandre, di peglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Nono lono mina Moses nono di noro, Yoba mabuno yegl ta erabuka i, kobuglo si, si golo dugwa. Ba ene siragl we di pitne? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Ye yegl digwa i, Jisas ka tau aglau ere dinan, kot ere tenamnedi prisre, kira yegl peglkwa. Ye yegl erikwa ba Jisas bodugl moglsre, ogo mogo mina makan kugane yomara ka tau boglsre, ka ta dikrukwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Ana Jisas ka ta dikruko, God lomo beke teigwa yoba ya Farisi yoba i, kira pogl meglkwa. Kira pogl meglko, Jisas adiglsre, ye yegl di togwa, Yoba ta tadaglme swara ta erekrukwa ta morabuka i, ye komono kana kobuglo ta idre, abu i kobuglo sinabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Ye yegl didre, aglke kor bodugl mogl, makan kugane mina ka tau bogl moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Yegl eruko, yoba ta abu auro yuigwa i, ye ka dugwa i prisre, swara swarade dumo i kide kodidre, ede eigwa. Yoba tau bugla yugu mere ne, ede okna eigwa i, komono kana ede eigo, tau gakamugl meglkwa i, okuo ede eigo, Jisas ya abu i keme yoba gumuglnomugl yoko miurka.<verse eid="JHN 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yoko miurko, Jisas adiglsre, abu i yegl di prukwa, Ye ede aglo eime? Yoba ta ene kot ere tenaiglkwa i, ta moglkrimo? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Dugo, abu i di ikne ede, Yagl Kade yo, ta moglkrimiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas yegl di togwa, Na ama ene kot ere tekraglka. Ene pidre, tadaglme okuo ere moglkro dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas makandigle yoba abuglageno moluwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Ana Jisas aglke kor yoba magigl meglkwa i, yegl di togwa, Na makandigle yoba abuglageno moluwa. Yoba ta na duglo borabuka i, ye mim erumara wan moglkrabuka ba ye abuglage ta ye kor morabedi tenabuka sumara wan morabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Dugo, Farisi yoba ere mogl, Jisas yegl di teigwa, Ene ira motnga i, yoba ta di nogugl edekrikwa. Ene swara dinga pre ene kanen kuno ta erekrumiwe digwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na nana kana dibo, i ka kaima panabuka. I siragl pre na aglo mere mogl wiga ya te, ede aglo mere enaglka i, na pre kan erika. Ba ene meglkwa i, na aglo mere mogl wiga ya ede aglo mere enaglka i, ene pre kan erekrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Ene makadigle yoba kan yubu simere mere yoba kan yubu sigwa ba na yoba kan yubu sikrika.<verse eid="JHN 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Te, na yoba ta kan yubu sibo, na mabuno kaima pamere mere kan yubu sinaglka. I siragl pre na nana primere kogon erekrika ba na Nina na dedugwa i, bogl akie muglko, kogon erika. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Te, ene lono mina dugwa i, yoba suo ere mogl, ka swara ta dibr, yoba ye kaima dibredi praiglme dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Na nana kana diga i, yoba swara ta dugwa mere yegl paugwa. Te, na Nina, na dedugwa i, ye ama na kana dugwa pre yoba suo na kana dibrika mere yegl pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, Farisi yoba ye di pre, Ene nen aglo mere moglkwa pre dine? digwa. Digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na siragl mere moglka i, ene pre kan erekrisre, na Nina ama pre kan erekrikwa. Ene na pre kan erima, na Nina ama pre kan eriko, we di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Jisas ka yegl dugwa i, ye tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna moglsre, yoba ka beke togwa igne dugwa. Te, togl suna i, yoba mige ofa yu teimara dumo i moglsre, ka yegl dugwa ba yoba swara ta ye si kane sikrikwa. I siragl pre ye gorabuka egemo i ta ukrukwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba di tedre, Na enaglmara i, ene ta wibi, kuno erekrabiwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Ana Jisas aglke kor yoba ka yegl di togwa, Na ede bage ta ebo, ene na dokidre, na ta kankraiglkwa. Te, ene tadaglmeno mina atne pai mogl, goraiglkwa. Na enaglmara i, ene ta wibi, kuno erekrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Jisas yegl dugo, Juda yoba kade magigl meglkwa i di ikne ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ye yene wi si gorabuka pre dumo mo? Siragl pre ye dugwa, Na enaglmara i, ene ta wibi, kuno erekrabiwe di, yegl dume digwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Ka yegl di ikne ikne edigo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene kamun atne nem meglkwa ba na kamun mitna nem moglka. Ene makandigle yoba meglkwa ba na makandigle yoba ta moglkrika. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Yegl pre na ene di tedre, Ene tadaglmeno mina atne pai mogl, goraiglme diga. I siragl pre na Yoba siragl mere mole diga i, ene na kaima yegl moglmedi prikribi, ene tadaglmeno mina atne pai mogl, goraiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Yegl dugo, ye di pre, yegl digwa, Ene ira motne? digwa. Digo, Jisas didre, Na ira moglka i, na kamun kuade ene di te kodiga. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Na ene mabunono kan yubu sidre, di poraglka paugwa ba na erme ta dikraglka. Siragl pre Yoba ta na dedugwa i, ka kaima keme dugo, ye ka di narumere keme makandigle yoba di teiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Ana Jisas Yoba ta na dedume dugwa i, ye Neno Kade pre dugwa ba ye nomane yegl ta ikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Yegl pre Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, ene na ake i mitna edenaiglkwa igne, na Moglmere Pai Moglmedi kan pogl sinaiglkwa. Te, na nana primere kogon ta erekrika ba na Nina ka beke narumere keme ka beke teiga. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Yoba ta na dedugwa i, ye na kide kodokrukwa ba ye na bogl akie muglka. I siragl pre ye mabuno tau wakai kanugwa i, na ege ege yegl keme eriwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugwa igne, yoba pre meglkwa i, tau mere ye pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas yoba di te, Ene ka kaima paugwa i pre pogl sibi, kane paikraiglme dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Ana Jisas ere mogl, Juda yoba tau ye pre mediglkwa i, yegl di togwa, Ene na kana duglo bogl meglbi, ene na duglo beglkwa yoba kaima moraiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Te, ka kaima paugwa i, ene pre pogl sinaiglkwa. Pre pogl sibi, ka kaima i, ene ake ple di tenan, ene kane ta paikraiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Jisas yegl dugo, yoba tau prisre, di ikne ede, yegl digwa, No Abraham gawama moglsre, ege swara ta kane paikrumga. Yegl pre siragl eruko, ene no kane paikraiglmiwe dine? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yegl digo, Jisas aglke kor ye yegl di togwa, Na ene kaima di teiga, yoba tadaglme erikwa i, mudu tadaglme mina atne kane paigwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Te, kane yoba meglkwa i, ye bitno yoba kipaimara aimadi kipai moglkraiglkwa ba yugu nem Wam moglkwa i, ye yugu i mina aimadi morabuka. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Yegl pre God Wam ene kane pai dinaiglmedi eran, ene kane paikre, yoko kaima moraiglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ene Abraham gawamo meglkwa i, na prika. Ba na kana ene deno muduno mina paikrukwa pre ene na si goramnedi erikwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Na Nina bogl akie muglko, ye ka siragl mere dugwa i, na prisre, ene di teiga. Ba ene neno ka siragl mere dugo, prikwa i, ene sika simiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Dugo, yoba i di ikne ede, Abraham no neno moglmiwe digwa. Yegl digo, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ene kaima Abraham gawama meglbi, ene Abraham mabuno erumere yegl eraiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Ba God ka kaima ta di narumere ene di teiga pre na si goramnedi erikwa. Abraham mabuno yegl ta erekrukwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Ene neno mabuno erumere ka kaima ere meglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, No konbauna gak ta moglkrumga. God swara no Neno moglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Digo, Jisas yegl di togwa, God ene Neno moglma, ene ama na wakai kanigo. I siragl pre na God bogl akie muglko, wiga. Te, na nana primere ukrika ba God na dedugo, wiga.<verse eid="JHN 8:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Na ka digo, ene prikrikwa i, siragl eruko, ene prikrime? Mem yegl paugwa, ene na kana praiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrabuka. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />I siragl pre ene yagl kide gagiglma moglsre, ene neno mabuno tau eragledi prukwa i, ene ama eramnedi prikwa. Yagl kide i, ye okna ibo yoba si goglkwa yagl moglsre, erme ama yegl moglkwa. Te, ka kaima mabuno i, ye moglmara paikrukwa pre mabuno kaima i duglo boglkrukwa. Ye ka kibi dugwa igne, ye yene kamo dugwa. Siargl pre ye ka kibi dugwa yagle moglsre, yoba ka kibi kane kane digwa i, ama mabuno moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Ba na ka kaima keme di wan moglka pre ene na pre mediglkrikwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Na tadaglme ege swara ta eriko, ene ta kanimo? Ta kankrikwa. Ba na ka kaima dibo, siragl eruko, ene na pre mediglkrime? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Yoba ta God yobamo moran, ye God kamo prabuka. Ba ene God yobama ta moglkrikwa pre ene na kana ta prikrimiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham moglkrukwa igne, Jisas Na Moluwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ana Jisas yegl dugwa pre Juda yoba di ikne ede, yegl digwa, No ene Samaria yoba motne didre, murubuglo kide ta motnara suna moglme dumga i, kuno dumga pamiwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, Murubuglo kide ta na moglmara suna moglkrukwa. Na Nina kagie kade te moglka ba ene na kagna ake atne keme edigwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Na moglka i, na nana kagna kade inagledi ere wan moglkrika ba yoba swara ta na kagna kade narabuka i, ye jas kaima moglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Na ene kaima di teiga, Yoba ta na kana ake gi dinan, ye aimadi kamun moglsre, kaima ta goglkrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, Juda yoba ye yegl di teigwa, No erme pre pogl sumga i, murubuglo kide ta ene motnara suna moglkwa paugwa. Abraham okna ibo mogl, goglko, ka kep yoba okna meglkwa i ama geglkwa. Ba ene dinga i, Yoba ta na kana ake gi dinan, ye aimadi kamun moglsre, kaima ta goglkrabiwe dinga. <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Ba Abraham goglko, ka kep yoba okna meglkwa i ama geglkwa erukwa pre ene yagl kade mogl, kowano awano Abraham egre atne ediedi pitno? Ene yoba ira moledi pitne? di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na nana kagna ake i mitna edibo, kuno erekrabuka. Ba yagl ta no Godno moglme digwa ikra, ye na Nina moglsre, yene kagna kade nare moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Na ye pre kan erika ba ene ye ka kaima ta pre kan erekrikwa. Te, na ere mogl, God pre kan erekriwe dibo, ka i kibi panabuka. Ba ene ka kibi dimere yegl, na ta dikraglka. Ka kaima keme dinaglka. Na ka kaima God pre kan ersre, ye kamo ake gi di moglka.<verse eid="JHN 8:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ene kowano awano Abraham i, ye na unabuka ege i we di prisre, gun yogwa. Te, ye eglke mogl, ege i kanugwa mere yegl paugwa pre gun yomiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Jisas yegl dugo, Juda yoba yegl digwa, Ene yagl kulu moglsre, bugla yugu 50-pela mere yegl ta nekitnga ba ene Abraham kanga pre dino? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yegl digo, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Abraham moglkrukwa igne, Na Moluwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Jisas yegl dugo, Juda yoba magigl meglkwa i, ye kobuglo sinamnedi kobuglo akigwa ba Jisas teke pai, tawa teigwa yugu yomara i, kide kodo, ede ogwa.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yagl ta gumuglo kin yogwa i, Jisas ere wakai erukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Ana ege swara ta Jisas konbauna wan mogl, yagl ta gumuglo kin yogwa i, kanugwa. Yagl i, mam ye kuglmara i, gumuglo kin yogwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ama yagl i kandre, Jisas di pre, yegl digwa, Tisa yo, ira tadaglme erumara pre yagl i gumuglo kin yome? Yene tadaglme erukwa pai erumo mo ye nem mam tadaglme eribrika pai erume? digwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus heals blind man" file="Cn01739B.tif" size="col" loc="9.2" copy="David C. Cook" ref="9.2" /> <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl i gumuglo kin yogwa i, yene tadaglme erumara plau dikruko, te ye nem mam tadaglme eribrara ama plau dikrukwa ba God ye moglmara kogon podo ta eran, yoba kanaiglkwa pre plau dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />God na dedugwa i, kogonmo ere moramga paugwa. I siragl pre erme erimine mere yegl yogwa. Eduer mere yegl yenan, kogon erumun, manabuka. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Na makandigle wan moraglka igne, na makandigle yoba abuglageno mere yegl moluwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, eur si makan mina edugwa. Edidre, ye eur sumara makan gaba tau buglkwa i idre, yagl ta gumuglo kin yogwa i gumuglo mina gaba buglsre, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene pi, nigl nubun ta Siloam we dimara i nigl paio! dugwa. Nigl nubun kagie Siloam i, mem paugwa i, Dedugwa. Jisas ka yegl dugo, yagl i ede pi nigl padre, ede ikne ugwa igne, ye gumuglo mina kan pogl sugwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Ana yagl i, gumuglo u wakai ogo, yoba tau ye kipamara magigl kipaigwa ya ye guma dra okna kanigwa i, di ikne ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yagl i, ye okna konbo bina ame di mogl, mige pre yana di moglkwa ikra moglmkana we digwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Yegl digo, yoba tau di ikne ede, Kaima, yagl i moglmiwe digwa. Ba yoba tau digwa i, yegl digwa, Ta manugwa. Ye yagl i moglkrukwa ba ye moglmere mere yegl moglkwa pamiwe digwa. Yegl digo, yagl i yegl dugwa, Ta manugwa. Na yagl ikra moluwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Yegl di moglkwa pre yoba ye di pre, Siragl eruko, ene gumuglno u wakai ome? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Yegl digo, ye di ikne ede, Yagl ta ye kagie Jisas we digwa i, ye makan gaba tau buglkwa erabedi ersre, gumuglna mina buglkwa. Ye yegl ersre, na di nare, Ene pi nigl nubun Siloam we dimara nigl paio! dugwa. Yegl dugo, na pi nigl paigo, na gumuglna u wakai omiwe di, yagl i yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Yegl dugo, yoba ye di pre, Yagl Jisas i, aglo moglme? digwa. Digo, ye di ikne ede, Na ta kankriwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Ana yagl ta okna gumuglo kin yogwa i, yoba ere mogl, auro i pi Farisi yoba meglmara edigwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Ana Jisas ye makan gaba tau buglkwa erabedi ersre, yagl i gumuglo ere wakai ere togwa ege i, wakan kade ege yogwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Ana Farisi yoba ama siragl mere gumuglo u wakai ogwa i, yagl i kira pogl prikwa. Kira pogl priko, yagl i ye yegl di togwa, Yagl i ye na gumuglna mina gaba buglko, na pi nigl paigo, gumuglna u wakai omiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Yegl dugwa pre Farisi yoba tau ere mogl, yegl digwa, Yagl ta ye gumuglo ere wakai ere togwa i, ye God bogl moglkribrika paugwa. I siragl pre ye lo si buko didre, wakan kade ege kogon erumiwe digwa. Yegl digwa ba Farisi yoba tau yegl digwa, Ye tadaglme yoba moran, ye siragl mere kimagl yegl ta erabe? digwa. Yegl pre Farisi yoba meglmara suna i, ye di pere pere edigwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Ana Farisi yoba ere mogl, yagl ta gumuglo kin yogwa i, aglke kor yegl di prikwa, Yagl i, ye ene gumugln ere wakai ere togwa. Yegl pre ene ye siragl mere moglmedi pitne? digwa. Yegl digo, yagl i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ye God kamo kep yoba ta moglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Ana yagl i gumuglo kin yedre, u wakai ome dugwa i, Juda yoba kade wagle i, ye kaima dumedi pre mediglkrikwa pre ye nem mam agle digo, ubrika. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Ubriko, ye di pre, yegl digwa, Yagl i, ene wano moglmo? Te, ene ye kiurka igne, ye gumuglo kin yomiwe di, ene yegl ta dibro? Te, siragl eruko, ye gumuglo u wakai ome? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Yegl digo, yagl i nem mam di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ye no wano moglkwa ya no ye kuglka igne ye gumuglo kin yogwa i, no kan pogl subuglka <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />ba siragl eruko, ye gumuglo erme wakai yogwa ya te, ira ye gumuglo ere wakai ere togwa i, no ta pre kan erekrubuglka. Yene di prio. Ye yagl denbigl moglkwa pre ye yene dinabiwe di, yegl dibrika. <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22-23" />Yagl i nem mam yegl dibrika i, siragl pre ye Juda yoba kade wagle kuduglno geglbrika pre dibrika. Siragl pre Juda yoba kade wagle i, ye di padigl kodigwa i, yoba ta ere mogl, Jisas ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglmiwe dinan, ye si meda edinamniwe digwa. Si meda edumun, ye yoba ka mabuno yugu makai simara i, okuo ta ukrabiwe digwa pre yagl i nem mam kudugl goglsre, Ye yagl denbigl moglkwa. Yene di prio di, yegl dibrika.<verse eid="JHN 9:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Ana Farisi yoba yagl ta gumuglo okna kin yogwa ikra aglke kor agle didre, ye di te, yegl digwa, God swara kagie kade to! Yagl kimagl erukwa ikra tadaglme yoba moglmedi pre pogl sumniwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Yegl digo, yagl i di ikne ede, Ye tadaglme yoba moglmo mo moglkrumo mo i, na ta pre pogl sikrika. Ba na taragl swara ta pre pogl siga i, yegl paugwa, na gumuglna okna kin yogwa ba erme na kan pogl siwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Dugo, Farisi yoba ye aglke kor yegl di prikwa, Ye ene siragl ere tome? Ye siragl mere ersre, ene gumugln ere wakai ere tome? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Yegl digo, ye di ikne ede, Na ene di te kodiga ba ene prikrikwa. Ene siragl pre aglke kor pramnedi prime? Ene ama yagl i duglo beglkwa yoba moramnedi primo? dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ye yegl dugo, Farisi yoba ye kenaglmo podo sidre, yegl digwa, Ene yagl i duglo boglnga paugwa ba no Moses duglo bunga yoba munga. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />No pre pogl sumga i, God Moses ka di tomedi prumga ba yagl i aglo mere mogl ugwa i, no ta pre kan erekrumniwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Yegl digo, yagl i di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Digwa i na nagna podo koglka. Yagl i na gumuglna ere wakai ere narukwa be ye aglo mere mogl ugwa i, ta prikrimo? <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tadaglme yoba agle di primere God ere tekrukwa i, nono prumga. Ba yoba ta God kuduglmo goglsre, God yoba eraiglmedi prumere mere yegl erabuka i, God ye agle di prabere ere tenabuka. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Te, ene prio! Mana na kuglmara gumuglna kin yogo, ye gumuglna ere wakai ere narukwa i, taragl yegl mere okna ege swara ta plau dugo, kankrumga. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />God ye yagl i dedekruma, ye kogon yegl mere ege swara kaima ta erekruko, we dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Yegl dugo, Farisi yoba di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Man ene kuglkwa igne, ede u erme pra, tadaglme mabuno ene motnara kau sugwa. Ene yegl mere moglsre, ka beke notno? digwa. Yegl didre, ye si meda ede, okuo ka mabuno yugu yugugl ta ukrabiwe digwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba ta Jisas pre mediglkrikwa i, ye gumuglno kin yogwa mere yegl meglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Ana Farisi yoba ye yagl i si meda edigwa i, yoba Jisas di teigo, prukwa. Ye prisre, yagl i doko kan, ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene Yoba Wam pre mediglno? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Yegl dugo, yagl i di ikne ede, Yagl Kade yo, ye ira moglme? Ene di natn, na ye pre medraluwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Dugo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Ye kan kodinga. Na erme ene ka di te moglka i, na Yoba Wam moluwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Dugo, yagl i yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na pre mediluwe dugwa. Didre, Jisas goglko bodugl tedre, ye kagie kade togwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yagl i yegl eruko, Jisas ere mogl, ka ta yegl dugwa, Na ede makandigle wiga i, na yoba kan yubu sinagledi wiga. Yoba gumuglno kin yogwa i, kanibi, yoba ta kan pogl sumnedi prikwa i, gumuglno kin yenabedi wiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Jisas yegl dugo, Farisi yoba tau magigl meglkwa i prisre, Jisas di pre, yegl digwa, No gumuglno kin yomedi pitnga pre dino? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye di tedre, Ene gumuglno kin yenan, ene tadaglmeno ta paikrabuka ba ene digwa i, no taragl mudu kan pogl sumniwe digwa pre ene tadaglmeno pai moglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ye yagl ta sipsip sugl wakai moglkwa mere yegl mole dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Sheep pen" file="lb00014b.tif" size="span" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="10.1" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na ene di pogl tenaglka i, yoba ta sipsip togl suna meglmara togl dra yomara ukre, togl bage ere ede suna ogwa i, i kunogl gogl yoba ogwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ba yoba ta togl dra yomara unabuka i, ye kaima sipsip sugl moglkwa yagl ogwa pre <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />togl sugl moglkwa yagl ta morabuka i, togl dra yauro tenan, ye ede suna enabuka. Ye ede sipsip meglmara pidre, ye sipsipmo swara swarade kagno daran, ye nugu ebrie prisre, sika sibi, ye auro i ede togl meda enabuka. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ye togl meda edidre, ede okna ogo, ye sipsipmo nugu ebrie prisre, sika si ede enaiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ba yoba pere ta u agle dinan, sipsip i, ye nugu ebrie prikrikwa pre kudugl gogl, moglmara teke ede pere pere enaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Jisas ka padum yegl dugwa ba yoba pre meglkwa i, ka ebriemo pre pogl sikrikwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yegl pre Jisas ka ebrie ikra di pogl tedre, yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, sipsip togl dra mere yegl na moluwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Yoba na ta ukrika igne okna wigwa i, mudu kunogl gogl yoba meglkwa ba sipsip i, ye kano prikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Na wiga i, na nana togl dra moglka. Yoba na wagle ede suna wibi, God ye ere inabuka. Ye ere inan, yoba i ye sipsip gun yei, u ikne ikne pi wan mogl, kugl wakai ne mogl pai erimere mere yegl, wakai moraiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Ana kunogl yoba we, ye kunogl nedre, si goglsre, ere kide keme eramnedi wigwa ba na we, na yoba kwiano kor enan, kor meglkwa mabuno ye meglmara kau kaima sinabuka pre wiga.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />Na sipsip sugl wakai moglkwa yagl ta moglka. Yagl ta sipsip sugl wakai morabuka i, ye ama sipsip ere inagledi gorabuka. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12-13" />Yoba ta sipsip nem moglkre, kogon yoba yoko ta morabuka i, mogl enabuka ba agl are unabuka igne, sipsip wakai moraiglmo mo moglkraiglkwa i, nomane sikrabuka. Ye yene we di prisre, kide kodo ede enabuka. I siragl pre ye sipsip sugl moglkwa yagle kaima ta moglkrukwa pre teke ede enabuka. Teke ede enan, agl are udre, sipsip ere si kike, pia si, pere pere edenabuka.<verse eid="JHN 10:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Na ka kaima sipsip sugl wakai moglkwa yoba moluwa. Na sipsipna meglkwa i, na pre kan eriko, ye ama na pre kan erikwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Nono ikne ikne pre kan erumnere mere yegl, na Nina na pre kan eruko, na ama ye pre kan erika. Te, na sipsip i ere inagledi goragliwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Jisas aglke yegl dugwa, Na sipsipna tau ama meglkwa i, ene meglmara suna i ta moglkrikwa ba bage tau meglkwa. Na ye meglmara pi agle dibo, nuguna ebrie pre wibi, ene pra pra mudu togl swara moraiglkwa. Meglbi, na ene mudu sugl moraglka.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />Na gogl, adigl u kor enaglka pre goraglka i, na Nina wakai prisre, dem muduo narukwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Yoba ta na si goraiglkwa ta moglkrikwa ba na nana primere goragledi prika. Na goraglka ya adigl u kor enaglka i, na moglmara nana mina yogwa. Na Nina, Yegl ero! dugwa pre nana mina yogwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, yoba ye ka dugwa pre meglkwa i, yene buno di u suo eigwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Yoba mere digwa i, ye ka dugwa i, murubuglo kide suna moglko, dumiwa. Du eruma, kide kodio digwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Ba tau digwa i, I ta manumiwa. Murubuglo kide morabuka yoba ka yegl ta dikraiglkwa. Te, murubuglo kide yoba gumuglno kin yogwa i, ere wakai erekraiglmiwe digwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba tau kobuglo idre, Jisas si goramnedi erikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ana igne i bi erukwa ege yogo, Juda yoba egeno kade ta ugwa. Ege kade i, okna ibo tawa teigwa yugu i, God yugumo yomedi i nogugl edinamnedi pre meglkwa egemo yogo, yoba makai si meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Ege i, Jisas tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna udre, yugu dramugl teka ta Solomon verandamo we dimara i wan moglko, <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Juda yoba kade u ye moglmara mogl winabo didre, yegl di prikwa, No kanana sugl muniwa. Ene God Kere Yugwa Yagl motn, erme nogugl di noro! digwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Ana yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ene di te kodiga ba ene na pre mediglkrikwa. Te, na Nina kagie mina kogon kane kane erika i, ama i nogugl edugwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ba ene na sipsipna moglkrikwa pre na pre mediglkrikwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Na sipsipna ira meglkwa i, na ye pre kan eriko, na nuguna ebrie prisre, na sika sigwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28-29" />Na sika sigo, ye aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa i, teiga. Na teigo, ye idre, ta goglkraiglkwa. Te, na Nina sipsip ogona mina yogwa i, ye yobuglomo pai kawa togwa pre na ogona mina meglkwa i, yoba ta i eglke edekrisre, na Nina ogo mina yogwa i, ama i eglke edenaiglkwa ama kuno erekrukwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:28-29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Na Nina bogl swara kaima mugliwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugo, Juda yoba kade wagle ye okna erimere yegl, aglke kor Jisas kobuglo si, si goramnedi kobuglo akigwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Kobuglo akigo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na Nina di narumere, na kogon wakai kane kane ene ere teiga i, kogon swara ta kide prisre, na kobuglo sinamnedi erikwa i, di nario! dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, Juda yoba di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ene kogon wakai ta etnga pre no ene kobuglo ta sikramga ba ene God kagie ere kide etnga pre no ene sinamnedi prumga. I siragl pre ene yoba keme motnga ba ene God moluwe diniwe digwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yegl digo, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ene kowanoma God kamo swara ta togo, beglkwa i mina God yegl dugwa, Ene god meglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 82.6</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Ana God kamo aimadi panabuka i mina Ene god meglmiwe dugwa ta panan, <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />siragl eruko, Na God Wam mole diga i, pre aglau erime? I aglau ta paikrukwa. Na Nina yene na i pere edidre, na ede makandigle enatnedi na dedugwa pre God kagie ere kide etniwe ta dikraiglme dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Na Nina kogonmo ta erekrika panan, pra, ene na pre mediglkraiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ba ye kogonmo erika panan, ka dimara pre kide prisre, na pre mediglkraiglkwa ba kimagl erika i, kandre, ka kaima pre medraiglkwa paugwa. Ene nomane yegl ibi, na Nina na moglmara suna moglko, na ama ye moglmara suna moglmedi kan pogl sinaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Jisas yegl dugo, ye aglke kor ye si akenamnedi erikwa ba siragl mere ede meda ogwa i, kankrikwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Ana Jisas aglke dumo i kide kodidre, ede nigl Jordan koglo ibo ogwa. Ye ede pi Jon okna yoba nigl bugl te moglmara pidre, dumo i pai moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Pai moglko, yoba tau mere ye moglmara udre, yegl digwa, Jon okna kimagl swara ta eruko, ta kankrumga ba ye yagl i pre ka mere dugwa i, mudu plau dumiwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Te, dumo i, yoba tau mere Jisas pre mediglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Yagl Lasarus goglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Ana aglke ta yagl ta kagie Lasarus we digwa kide sugwa. Ye dumo Betani we dimara kipai moglkwa. Dumo Betani i, Lasarus abauglo suo Maria ya Marta ama kipai meglbrika. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Maria i aglke ta kugo nuglo demene wakai erukwa Yagl Kade kagle wagle toide edidre, bre yugo mina kokugwa. Maria i agigle Lasarus kide sugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Ana Lasarus kide sugwa pre ye abauglo suo ere mogl, yoba ta dedebriko, ye pi Jisas yegl di togwa, Yagl Kade yo, yagl ta ene boma daguma meglbrika ikra kide sumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yegl dugo, Jisas prisre, yegl dugwa, Lasarus kide sugwa i, ye ta gogl dudukrabuka. Ye kide sugwa i, God kagie wanabuka pre erukwa. Te, na God Wam moglka i, ye kide sumara i, na ama kagna wanabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Ana Jisas ye Marta ya Maria ya Lasarus pra, wakai kanugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ye wakai kanugwa ba ye Lasarus kide sugwa i prisre, tabre pi kankrukwa. Ye moglmara ege suo mogl pai moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Moglsre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl mudu di te, Nono ede ikne distrik Judia, yagl Lasarus moglmara omno dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Tisa, edue iga Juda yoba kobuglo si, ene si goramnedi erikwa. Yegl erikwa pre ene erme ede ikne enatno? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yegl digwa ba Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Kamun tagugwa igne ede pi mim erukwa igne, ade kwia 12-pela yogwa. Yoba ta ade kwia 12-pela suna i konbauna enan, ye ta guglo sikrabuka. I siragl pre abuglage si makandigle edugo, ye kan pogl sugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ba mim eran, yoba ta konbauna enan, abuglage si ye moglmara edekrukwa pre ye guglo sinabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Jisas ka yegl didre, ye ka ta ama yegl di togwa, Nono kabagleno Lasarus i, ugl paugwa. Ye ugl paugwa ba na ye uglo yokinagledi pre ede ikne omno die dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Yagl Kade yo, ye ugl panan, aragan erabiwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Jisas ye Lasarus ugl pame dugwa i, Lasarus goglkwa pre dugwa ba ye duglo beglkwa yagl prikwa i, ka kaima ugl paugwa pre dumedi prikwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yegl prikwa pre Jisas di nogugl ede, yegl dugwa, Lasarus goglmiwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />Te ye goglkwa igne moglkrika i, gun yeiga. Siragl pre na ene we di prisre, na siragl ta eribo, ene na pre medraiglmedi prika. Ana nono ede pi Lasarus i pi yeimara omno! di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Jisas yegl dugwa pre Tomas, kagie ta Didimus we digwa i, ye Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Ana, nono ede omno! Yoba ta ere mogl, Jisas si geglbi, nono ama akie goramniwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ere mogl, Yoba na swara mina adigl u kor pidre, kor moraiglme dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Ana Jisas ede dumo Betani magigl ugo, yoba ye di te, Lasarus kobuglo mur yeigwa, ege 4-pela de ede omiwe digo, prukwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Dumo Betani i, Jerusalem we dimara magigl yogwa. Jerusalem we dimara ede pi Betani i, 3 kilomita mere yegl yogwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Magigl yogo, Juda yoba mere Marta ya Maria agro goglkwa pre deno muduno aragan erabedi pi kanigwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Ana Jisas ede magigl ugo, yoba ere mogl, Jisas umiwe digo, Marta prukwa. Prisre, ye tegigl yenabugledi ede pi Jisas umara ogwa. Ye ede ogwa ba Maria yugugl mogl pai moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Marta ede pi Jisas umara pidre, ye yegl di togwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene magigl i motna, na agra ta goglkruko. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ba na pre kan erika i, erme ama ene God siragl mere di pitn, ye ene dinatnere ere tenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Marta ka yegl di kodugo, Jisas ye di te, Ene agitn adigl u kor enabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Dugo, Marta ye yegl di togwa, Kaima. Ege okuo, yoba mudu adigl u kor enaiglkwa igne, ye ama adigl u kor enabuka i na priwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye aglke kor yegl di togwa, Yoba na swara mina adigl u kor pidre, kor moraiglkwa. Yoba na ta pre mediglsre, goran, ta goglkrabuka. Kor mogl pai morabuka. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Te, yoba ta kor moglsre, na pre medran, ye kaima ta goglkrabuka. Na ene di teiga i, ene pre mediglno? Jisas yegl di prukwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Di pruko, Marta ye di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, na pre mediglka. Ene God Wam moglsre, God Yagl ta dedenan, ede makandigle unabe digwa i, ene motnedi pre mediluwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lasarus goglkwa i pre Jisas kai erukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ana Marta ka yegl didre, ye ede ikne abauglo Maria moglmara pidre, ye swara prabedi yegl dugwa, Tisano udre, ene wo dumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Marta yegl dugo, Maria ka i prisre, tabre adigl ede pi Jisas moglmara ogwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Jisas ede dumo suna ukrukwa. Ye Marta bogl tegigl yeibrara ikra mogl pai moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Ana Maria tabre adigl ede ogo, Juda yoba ye dem muduo aragan erabedi gaugl wigwa ikra yugugl moglsre, kanigwa. Kandre, Maria ede kobuglo mur yeimara kai erabuka pre omedi prisre, ye mokomugl sika si eigwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Ana Maria ede Jisas moglmara pi Jisas kandre, ye Jisas adigl moglmara yage kagle mina kobragai padre, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene magigl i motna, na agra ta goglkruko we dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Maria yegl didre, kai eruko, Juda yoba ye mokomugl wigwa ikra ama kai eriko, Jisas kanugwa. Ye kandre, ye dem muduo yubun dogo, kide kaima prukwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Ye yegl ersre, yoba di pre, Ene Lasarus ogo nagie aglo yeime? dugwa. Jisas yegl di pruko, ye di ikne ede te, yegl digwa, Yagl Kade yo, ye yomnara kanatna wo digwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yegl digo, Jisas kai erukwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Ye kai eruko, Juda yoba kandre, yegl digwa, Kanio! Ye Lasarus dem muduo kaima tomiwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Yoba tau yegl digwa ba tau ama ere mogl, yegl digwa, Yagl i yagl ta gumuglo kin yogwa ere wakai ere togwa. Ye ama Lasarus goglkrabedi erabuka pamiba, erekrumiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye Lasarus ere i kor edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Lazarus coming out of tomb" file="CN01768B.TIF" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="11.38" />Yoba tau ka yegl digo, Jisas dem muduo aglke kor yubun dogo, ye Lasarus kobuglo mur yeimara ede magigl ogwa. Kobuglo dra i, kobuglo paglkane wagle si kegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Jisas ede kobuglo dra magigl pi, ye yoba di te, Kobuglo dra si kegl digwa i, ake nu si eglke edio! dugwa. Yegl dugo, yagl goglkwa abauglo Marta ye Jisas yegl di togwa, Yagl Kade yo, ye goglkwa, ege 4-pela de ede ogwa pre erme kubuno kide erabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Na ene okna di teiga ikra, Ene pre medigln, God yobuglomo podo paugwa i kanatne digra we dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Jisas yegl dugo, yoba kobuglo paglkane ikra ake nu si eglke edigwa. Edigo, Jisas kan mitna ibo ede, yegl dugwa, Nina yo, na ka ta ene erme di praglka i, ene pre kodinga pre na ene di wakai yei teiwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Na ege ege ene ka siragl mere di prika, ene prisre, dimere ere natnga i, na pre kan ere kodiga ba yoba magigl adigl meglkwa i praiglkwa pre diga. Ye prisre, ene ka kaima na dedinga i, pre medraiglkwa pre diwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ye ka podo yegl dugwa, Lasarus, ene ede meda wo! dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Dugo, yagl goglkwa i adigl u kor pidre, ede meda ugwa. Yoba okna ye kobuglo mur yeigwa igne, ogo kagle ya guma dra lap wagle tu sigwa i, pai moglko, ye ede meda ugwa. Ye ede meda ugo, Jisas yoba di te, yegl dugwa, Ene lap pirka si teo. Ye yoko wan morabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel yoba kade Jisas kanige eun, u kide enamne digwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matyu 26.1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mak 14.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Ana Jisas ere mogl, Lasarus ere i kor edugo, Juda yoba ede Maria moglmara wigwa ikra tau mere kandre, Jisas pre mediglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ye mere pre mediglkwa ba yoba tau we, ye ede pi Farisi yoba meglmara pidre, Jisas siragl mere erukwa i ye di teigwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Di teigo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya Farisi yoba ere mogl, Kaunsil di makai sigo, wigwa. Wigo, ye yegl digwa, Nono siragl eramne? digwa. Yagl i kimagl mere erukwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Nono kanige eremun, yoba mudu ye pre medraiglkwa. Yegl eribi, Rom yoba ye no king kor i nogugl edimedi kandre, u nono tawa tomga yugu i ere kide ersre, nono Israel yoba ama ere kide ere noro, eraiglmiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Ana Kaunsil wagle yegl digo, ye swarano kagie Kaiafas we digwa i, di ikne edugwa. Kaiafas ye bugla yugu i, tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglko, ye di ikne edidre, Ene nomane pre pogl sikre, dimiwe, di, ka togwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Ene wakai ta paugwa pre pogl sikrikwa i, nono yoba swara ta Israel yoba mudu againo idre, goran, wakai ta panabuka. Kowai Israel yoba mudu geglbi, wakai ta paikrabiwe di, Kaiafas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ye ka yegl dugwa i, ye yene prumere dikrukwa ba ye bugla yugu igne i tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglsre, Jisas ye Israel yoba pre gorabuka i, ka kep ere dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />Te, Jisas ye Israel yoba swara i pre goglkrabuka ba God gagiglma mudu uglo koglo koglo bage bage moraiglkwa i, ye ere i yugobunomo swara edenagledi gorabuka paugwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Ana igne i Juda yoba kade wagle mabuno bogl ka di kogl, siragl mere Jisas si goraiglkwa i, konbauna doko di meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Yegl pre igne i Jisas Juda yoba meglmara nogugl wan moglkre, dumo i kide kodidre, ede pi taun ta dumo wau yomara magigl yomara ogwa. Taun kagie Efraim we dimara i pidre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl dumo i meglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Ana ege i, ege kade God Israel yoba oglo sugwa igne ede magigl ugo, Israel yoba bina dage meglkwa i, ege i ede magigl umedi prisre, mudu God gumuglo mina deglbi yei dinamnedi ede okna pi Jerusalem ibo ere meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Ye tawa teigwa yugu yomara togl suna yegl ere moglsre, ka kade di yegl digwa, Nono ege kade yogo, ere munga i, Jisas u kanabo mo kankrabe? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Okna kana tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i ya Farisi yoba ka gigle di padigl, yegl digwa, Ene yoba ta we, Jisas atne ta moran, kanatnga i, di noro! No ye si kane sinamniwe digwa.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Maria kugo nuglo toide Jisas kagle mina edugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matyu 26.6-13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mak 14.3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Ana God Israel yoba oglo sugwa ege yenabuka 6-pela de pai moglko, Jisas ede dumo Betani ogwa. Betani i, Lasarus gogl pai moglko, Jisas ere i kor edugwa ikra ye yugomugl yogwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Ana dumo i ogwa pre Lasarus abauglo suo bogl di gaglsre, kaya mokna podo erikwa. Eriko, Marta kaya mokna ere wakai ere si moglko, Lasaras ye yoba bogl ame di, ka denbi di, kaya mokna ne meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Ame di meglko, Maria ye kugo nuglo demene wakai erukwa ta mige podo boglkwa i, wan kilo ikne mere yegl ta yogwa yudre, Jisas kagle mina toide edidre, bre yugo mina ye kagle koko edugwa. Yegl eruko, demene wakai wai di, yugugl i si kau sugwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Ana Maria yegl eruko, Judas Iskariot, ye Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ta Jisas i pi kudamo ikne ogono mina yenabuka ikra ere mogl, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" /><figure style="fig" alt="Triumphal entry" file="LB00315b.tif" size="span" copy="Louise Bass, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="12.5" />Ene siragl eruko, kugo nuglo i pi topo boglkrime? Topo beglma, nono mige silva 300 mere imna, goduglme yoba tomgo we dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Judas yegl dugwa i, ye nomanemo i ye goduglme yoba tenaiglkwa pre ta dikrukwa. Ye duglo beglkwa yoba mige gade igwa i, sugl moglsre, ama kunogl nedre, tebe atne edugwa yagle moglkwa pre ye ka yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Ana Judas ka yegl dugo, Jisas ere mogl, Ene ye kanige erio dugwa. Na maugl mina enaglka pre ye na ere kuno ere narukwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Goduglme yoba ene meglmara bogl ege ege moraiglkwa ba na ene bogl ta akie ege ege moglkramniwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i, ye Lasarus si goramnedi ka di keglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Ana yoba mere kide Jisas dumo Betani ume digo, yoba mudu oidi ede eigwa. Jisas igle moglmedi kanamnedi pidre, te, Jisas siragl mere Lasarus ere i kor edugwa i, i ama gumuglno mina kanamnedi ede eigwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10-11" />Ba tawa teigwa bitno yoba kandre, prikwa i, No ka dumga i, ye pre morakirimiwa. Pra pra Lasarus Jisas ere i kor edugwa i pi kandre, Jisas pre mediglkwa pre mogl, deno kubro, Lasarus ama si goramnedi ka di keglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas king mere yegl mogl, ede Jerusalem suna ugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matyu 21.1-11</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mak 11.1-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Ana tagna ta i, yoba mere kide ege kade pre Jerusalem meglkwa i, Jisas ede Jerusalem ume digo, ye prisre, <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />ede pam yogagle buko di idre, Jisas unan, tegigl yenamnedi ede eigwa. Ye pi mogl, ka kade di, yegl digwa, God kagie kade tomniwa! Yagl ta Yagl Kade dedugo, ugwa i, God ye ere wakai ere tenabiwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 118.25-26</char></note> Ye nono Israel yoba kingno moglmiwe! di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Ana Jisas ye donki kulu ta doko idre, donki moko bolamugl ame didre, ede ogwa. Ye yegl erumara i God kamo mina ka ta okna yegl beglkwa i, plau dugwa,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />Ene Saion yoba meglkwa i, kudugl goglkrio. Ene kingno moglkwa i, uma, kanio! Ye donki kulu ta moglkwa au sidre, ede umiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sekaraia 9.9</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 12:15">di, yegl beglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Komno kana Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba God kamo i ta plau dumedi prikrikwa. Prikrikwa ba okuo ime God ye Jisas kagie kade te kodugwa igne, ye pre ikne edidre, ege i, ka i ye pre beglkwa pamedi nomane igwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Ana okna Lasarus goglko, Jisas ye agle di, ere i kor edugwa i, yoba mere kan meglko, erukwa pre yoba mudu meglmara i, di wai digwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Yoba Jisas kimagl podo yegl erume di, di wai digwa pre yoba mere kide ye kanamnedi ede eigwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Yegl pre Farisi yoba kandre, yegl digwa, Yoba uglo koglo koglo ye duglo bogl ede eigwa pre nono di inamga mere manugwa. Kodinamniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Grik yagl tau ye Jisas kanamnedi prikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Ana yoba tau mere ege kade yomedi prisre, God kagie kade tenamnedi ede Jerusalem eimara suna i, Grik yagl tau ama eigwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Grik yagl i eigwa, ede Filip moglmara pi di prisre, Yagl kade yo, no Jisas kanamnedi umniwe digwa. Ana Filip i, ye dumo Betsaida, distrik Galili suna yogwa i, nem ta moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Yegl digo, Filip prisre, ede pi Andru moglmara pi dugo, ye Andru bogl akie ede Jisas moglmara pi di pribrika.<verse eid="JHN 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Ye pi di pribriko, Jisas ye di ikne ede yegl dugwa, Na Yoba Wam moglka i, kagna kade inaglka ege i, ede magigl u kodumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Na ene ka kaima di teiga, wit mogo koglko kanumnere mere yegl wit mogo ta yage makadigle sugwa i, goran, pra pare wi si, mogo mere kide korabuka. Ba yage si, goglkran, mogo ta koglkrisre, yene yoko yei pai morabuka. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Kuno yegl mere yoba erme goraiglkwa nomane ta sikraiglkwa i, okuo wakai kaima mogl, ye aimadi kor moraiglkwa. Ba yoba makadigle wakai moramnedi pre mitna edenaiglkwa i, okuo wau boraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Yoba ta na niglna kogona eragledi prabuka i, ye na enaglmara duglo borabuka paugwa. I siragl pre na aglo mere moraglmara i, na niglna kogona yoba ama moraiglkwa paugwa. Te, yoba ta na niglna kogona erabuka i, na Nina ye kagie kade tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas dugwa i, Yoba na ake i mitna edinaiglkwa pamiwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na dena muduna erme yubun dogwa ba na siragl eragle? Na Nina kamage ere, Ege kide i, na moglmara plau di dinabedi ero! dinaglo? Ta manugwa. Na ege kide i unabedi pre ede makadigle wiga. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Nina yo, enene kagn ake mitna edo! di, Jisas yegl dugwa. Yegl dugwa igne, ka ta heven ibo ugwa i, yegl dugwa, I praiwa. Na kagna ake i mitna ediwa. Te, na okuo ama ake i mitna edinaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Yegl dugo de, yoba mere kide magigl adigl meglkwa prikwa i, tau Kamun gur dume digo, tau Angelo ta ye ka ta di togwa pamiwe digwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Ana yoba ka yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ka ta ugwa i, na pre ta ukrukwa ba ene pre medraiglkwa pre umiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />God makandigle yoba ka tage tenabuka i, kwande ede magigl u kodugwa. U kodugo, te yagl kide bitno moglsre, dumo makan sugl moglkwa i, God ama ka tage tedre, si meda edenabuka i, ama magigl erumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na makadigle egre dinatnedi na ake i mitna edibi, paibo, yoba mudu ede u na moglmara unaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Jisas ka yegl dugwa i, ye kuri ta mogl, ede prak mina siragl mere gorabere di poglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, yoba magigl meglkwa i, aglke kor yegl digwa, No God lomo mina kere prumga i, God Kere Yugwa Yagl aimadi kamun morabe dugwa paugwa. Ba ene dinga i, yoba ere mogl, Yoba Wam ake i mitna edidre, ede prak mina sinaiglme diniwa. Yegl eraiglkwa panan, ene Yoba Wam i, ira pre dine? di, yegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yegl digo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Abuglage ene meglmara sugwa i, kuri ta mogl, dudunabuka. Abuglage kuri ta si pai morabara wan meglbi, mim u ene i atne edekrabuka. Yoba mim erumara wan meglkwa i, eimara dumo i, kan pogl sikraiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Ene abuglage kuri ta sinabuka pai moglmara i, pre medilo! Abuglage i pre mediglbi, ene abuglage sumara gak moraiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, yoba i kide kodo, ye kan dinaiglmedi ede ogwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba tau mere Jisas pre mediglkrikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ana Jisas yoba i gumuglno mina kimagl mere kaima i nogugl ede togwa ba ye pre medrakirikwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Ye pre mediglkrimara i mina ka kep yagl Aisaia ka ta okna boglkwa i, pai yugwa. Ye boglkwa i, yegl boglkwa, Yagl Kade yo, no ene kanen yoba di tomga i, ira pre mediglme? Ene kogon yobuglo etnga i, yoba okna kankrimere ye kanigwa ba ye pre mediglkrime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 53.1</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Yegl boglko, yoba i Jisas pre medraiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa. Kuno yegl mere Aisaia ka ta ama boglmere yegl, ye meglmara plau dugwa. Ye ka i, yegl boglkwa, <verse eid="JHN 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />God ye gumuglno kin yenabedi ersre, nomano si gigle di togwa. Ye yegl erukwa i, ye gumuglno mina kankribi, nomano gigle dinan, nomano yake tekribi, na ye kideno ere wakai ere te dinagledi erumiwe di, Aisaia yegl boglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 6.9-10</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Aisaia ka yegl boglkwa i, i siragl pre okna ibo ye Jisas abuglagemo podo sugo, kanugwa pre ka yegl boglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Juda yoba mere yegl erikwa ba yoba tau mere Jisas pre mediglko, te Juda yoba kade tau ama ye pre mediglkwa. Yoba kade i pre mediglkwa ba Di nogugl edumun we, Farisi yoba no ka mabuno yugu di meda ede dinaiglmedi prisre, kudugl gogl, pre mediglkwa i, ake i atne edigwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />I siragl pre yoba ye wakai kanaiglkwa i, pre i mitna edidre, God ye wakai kanabuka i, pre i atne edigwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoba na kana prikrikwa i mina ka inaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Ana Jisas ka kade di, yegl dugwa, Yoba ta na pre meduglkwa i, ye na swara keme pre mediglkrukwa ba yoba ta na dedugwa i ama pre meduglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Te, yoba ta na kanugwa i, na swara kankrukwa ba yoba ta na dedugwa i ama kanugwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Na ede makadigle wiga i, abuglage mere yegl wiga. Yegl pre yoba ta na pre medrabuka i, mim mina ta pai moglkrabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Yoba ta na kana prisre, duglo boglkrikwa i, na erme kot ere tekraglka. I siragl pre na makandigle wiga i, yoba kot ere tenagledi ukrika ba ye ere inagledi wiga. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Ba okuo ibo ka tage inaiglkwa ege i unan, na mokna nare, kana mokono teigwa yobamo i, na kana kaima pamara i mina ye ka tage tenabuka. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />I siragl pre na ka diga i, na nana primere ta dikrika ba na Nina na dedugwa i, Ka yegl yegl do! di, na dedumere keme diga.<verse eid="JHN 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Te, ka do dugwa i, yoba prisre, aimadi kamin kor moriaglmedi na pre kan erika. Mem kaima yegl paugwa pre na Nina do dumere i keme ene di teiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl kaglno nigl kogl togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Washing feet" file="cn01799B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="13.1" />Ana God Israel yoba oglo sugwa ege kade ede magigl u kodugo, Jisas ye yene prukwa i, ye makan kide kodidre, ede ikne Nem moglmara enabuka egemo yomedi pukwa. Prisre, ye yobama makadigle mogl pai meglkwa i, dem muduo podo togwa. Komono kana tomere mere erme ede ikne enagledi erumara te pai moglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Ana igne i yagl kide ye Judas, Saimon Iskariot wam ikra, Jisas i pi kudamo ikne ogono mina yenabedi nomane te kodugo, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl kaya mokna nenamnedi ame di meglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Ana Jisas pre kan erukwa i, Na Nina yobuglo bogl narsre, taragl pra pra na ogona mina yei kodugo, na ama moglka i, na God mina wiga te, erme ede ikne God moglkwa enagliwe di, pre kan erukwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Ye pre kodumara i mina ye ame di meglmara i, adigl, ye gaglmo olto gugl edidre, taul ta yogwa i pre padigl, <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />ye nigl tau toide dis mina ede, ye duglo beglkwa yagl kaglno nigl kogl togwa. Nigl kogl tedre, ye taul pre paduglkwa i mina nigl koko ede te ugwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Ana Jisas kaglno nigl kogl te, u Saimon Pita moglmara ugwa igne, Pita mane di pre, Yagl Kade yo, ene na kaglna nigl koratno? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Dugo, Jisas di ikne ede te, yegl dugwa, Ene na siragl erme erika i, ene pre pogl sikre diniba okuo pre kan eratniwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Yegl dugo, Pita di ikne ede, Ene erme mo okuo mo kaglna nigl koratnga i, pra we dikragliwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, Ene kagln ta nigl koglkribo, nono akie ta si dakagl moglkrabuluwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Yegl dugo, Saimon Pita prisre, Yagl Kade yo, yegl panan, ene na kaglna keme nigl edekre, ogona ya bitna ama nigl pai naro! dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Yoba nigl mudu pai kodigwa i, ye ta ogono nagino mudu panaiglkwa i ta paikrukwa. Kaglno keme keglbi, deglbi yekraiglmiwe dugwa. Ene pra pra meglkwa i, ene mudu deglbi yeikrikwa ba ene pra pra pre dikriwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Jisas ere mogl, Ene pra pra pre ta dikriwe dugwa i, yoba ira ta ye i pi kudamo ikne ogono mina yenabuka i, ye pre kan ere kodidre, dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ana Jisas mudu kaglno nigl kogl kodidre, ye gaglmo olto aglke ede ikne edidre, u agaimo yomara ame di moglsre, ye kira pogl di prukwa, Na siragl mere erme ere teiga i, ene pre kan pogl simo? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Ene na Tisa moglmiwe didre, Yaglno Kade moglmiwe digwa i, na kaima yegl moglka pre aglau ere ta dikrimiwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Yegl paugwa pre na Yaglno Kade moglsre, Tisano moglsre, erika ba na mogl atne ede, kaglno nigl ediga panan, ene ama mogl atne edidre, kaglno ikne ikne nigl koraiglkwa tenaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ere teimere yegl mere duglo boglsre, erio dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Nigl kogon yoba ta mogl mitna ede, ye yaglmo kade egre atne edekrabuka. Te, dedugwa yoba ta morabuka i, ye yoba ta ye kogon dedugwa i, ama egre atne edekrabuka. Atne morabuka. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Ene mabuno i, pre kan ere, duglo beglbi, God ene ere wakai ere tenan, gun yenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />Na ene ka yegl mere di teiga i, ene mudu pre ta dikrika ba na yoba ira ta kere iga i, na pre kan erika. Ba taragl ta plau dinabuka i, God kamo okna beglkwa i, pai inabedi plau dinabuka. God kamo mina beglkwa i, yegl beglkwa, Yoba ta na bogl akie bret nobuglka i, ye na egragledi ye kagle ake mitna edumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 41.9</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Taragl i, plau dikrukwa igne, eglke kana pai moglko, di teiga i, plau dinan, ene pre ikne edidre, na God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglmedi pre medraiglmedi prika.<verse eid="JHN 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Na ene ka kaima di teiga, Na yoba ta kogon dedibo, yoba ta ye di inabuka i, ye na ama di yugwa. Na di idre, Yoba ta na dedugwa i, ama di yumiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas Jisas i pi kuda ikne ogono mina yenagle dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matyu 26.20-25</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mak 14.17-21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22.21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugwa igne, ye dem muduo yubun dogo, ye ka yegl di nogugl edugwa, Na ene ka kaima di teiga, ene meglmara suna i, yagl swara ta na i pi kudana ikne ogono mina yenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl ye ira pre dugwa i pre pogl sikre, toro kan ikne ikne edigwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Ana Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl meglmara suna i, swarano ta Jisas ye wakai kaima kanugwa i, Jisas moglmara magigl kaima moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Yegl moglko, Saimon Pita ye arie ere tedre, yegl dugwa, Ye ira pre dugwa i, di pro dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Pita yegl dugo, Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta magigl moglkwa ikra, ye bre i pi Jisas pirie mina edidre, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene ira pre dine? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na bret bage ta i pi sup mina si bai, yagl ta tenaglka i, na yoba i pre diwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa. Yegl didre, bret bage ta i pi sup mina si bai, Judas, ye Saimon Iskariot wam moglkwa i, togwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Ana Judas ye bret bage i, i kodugo, Satan ye moglmara ede suna ogwa. Yegl erukwa pre Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene taragl ta eratnga i, tabre ero! dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ana Jisas ye siragl pre ka yegl mere Judas di togwa i, ye yobamo ame di meglkwa i, swara ta pre pogl sikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Ye tau prikwa i, Judas mige boks sugl moglkwa pre ege kade i, kaya mokna topo ere yunabedi pre dumo mo, mige tau i pi goduglme yoba tenabuka pre dumo mo, yegl pre ta dumedi prikwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Ana Judas ye bret bage ikra idre, tabre yene adigl ede meda ogwa. Igne i, eduer yogwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl di tedre, Na ene lo kor ta duglo boraiglmedi ene teiwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ana Judas ede meda ogwa igne, Jisas yegl dugwa, Erme na Yoba Wam moglka i, kagna kade inaglka ege yogwa. Te, na ibo, na Nina ama kagie kade inabuka. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Ana God na mina kagie kade inabuka pre ye yene ere mogl, na kagna kade narabuka. Te, ye yegl ere narabuka i, sugl ta moglkre, tabre narabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Na gagrama wagle, na ege sugunagle keme ene bogl akie moramga. Moramga ba na okna Juda yoba kade wagle di teimere yegl, erme ene ama yegl di tenaglka, na enaglmara i, ene na dokinaiglkwa ba na ta kankraiglkwa. Te, na enaglmara i, ene ta ebi, kuno erekrabuka.<verse eid="JHN 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ana erme na ene lo kor ta duglo boraiglmedi teiga. Lo kor i, yegl paugwa, Ene deno muduno ikne ikne teo. Na dena muduna ene teimere kuno yegl mere, ene deno muduno ikne ikne teo. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ene yegl eribi, yoba mudu ene kandre, ene na duglo beglkwa yoba meglmedi kanaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita ye Jisas moko tenabuka i pre Jisas dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matyu 26.31-35</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mak 14.27-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Ana Jisas yegl di kodugo, Saimon Pita ye di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene ede aglo enatne? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na enaglmara i, nono erme akie ta pikrabuglka ba ene okuo unatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Yegl dugo, Pita yegl di prukwa, Yagl Kade yo, siragl pre ene erme enaglnara na ukragle? Na ene pre goraglka panan, pra, na goraluwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Pita yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Ene na pre goratno? Na ene ka kaima yene di teiga, erme eduer koduagle kumugl ta wi sikran, ene ege suota na pre kan erekriwe dinatniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene deno muduno yubun dekrano. Ene God pre mediglsre, na ama pre medilo. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Na Nina yugumogl i, ene againo mogl pai eraiglkwa mere yogwa. Ta yekruma, ene di teigo. Na pi ene moraiglmara ere wakai eraglka. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Te, na pi ene moraiglmara ere wakai ere tebo, na aglke ede ikne u ene na moglmara akie moramnedi agre i ede enaglka. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Na enaglmara i, ene konbauna pre kan ere kodimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Ana Jisas yegl di kodugo, ye duglo boglkwa yagl Tomas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene aglo mere enatnga i, no ta pre kan erekunga pre konbomo i ama pre kan erekuniwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na konbauna moglsre, te ka kaima i, na mabuno moglsre, yoba kor moraiglkwa i, na mabuno moglsre, erika. Yoba ta ede pi na Nina moglmara enabuka i, konbauna pere ta mina ta pikrabuka. Na swara mina enabuka. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Na siragl mere moglka i, ka kaima prikwa panan, na Nina ama pre kan erikwa. Ba erme ene God kandre, ama ye pre kan pogl simiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, Filip ye di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, Ene Nen moglkwa i, obuno di noro. Obuno di notn, no kandre, wakai pramne dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Filip yo, na ene bogl tau kanana munga ba ene na pre kan erekitno? Yoba ta na kanugwa i, ye na Nina ama kan kodugwa. Yegl pre siragl eruko, ene na di narsre, Nen obuno di noro dine? dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Na Nina na moglmara suna moglko, na ye moglmara ama suna moglka i, ene pre mediglkitno? Na ka diga i, na nana primere ta dikrika. Na Nina yene na moglmara suna kogon eruko, na prisre, erika. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Na Nina moglmara suna moglko, ye na moglmara ama suna moglkwa i, ene pre medilo. Ba ta pre mediglkribi, na kogon kane kane erimara i mina pre medilo dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Na ene ka kaima di teiga, na ede Nina moglmara enaglka pre yoba ta na pre medran, na kogon erimere yegl ersre, ama kogon podo kaima erabuka. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Pre medigl mogl, God Wam moglka i, siragl kane kane na kagna mina kamage ere, di pribi, na Nina kagie kade inabedi ere wakai ere tenaglka. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Ene siragl kane kane na kagna mina di pribi, dimere eraluwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Ene deno muduno naribi, na kana duglo boraiglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Te, na Nina di pribo, ye Ake Ple Dugwa yoba ta aimadi kamin meglmara suna morabedi tenabuka. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Na Ake Ple Dugwa yoba we diga i, ka kaima mabuno i nogugl edugwa Murubuglo ikra ene tenabuka pre diga. God Muruboglomo erme ene bogl akie moglsre, te, okuo ene meglmara suna morabuka pre ene ye pre kan erikwa. Ba makandigle yoba ye kankre, pre pogl sikre, erikwa pre ye God Murubuglomo ta ikraiglme dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na ene kide kodibo, ene gak mua mere yegl mogl dinaiglmedi na ene meglmara ede ikne unaglka. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Na kuri ta moglbo, makandigle yoba okuo na ta kankraiglkwa ba ene na kanaiglkwa. Te, na kor moglmara i pre ene ama kor moraiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Na u kor enaglka igne, na Nina moglmara suna moglko, ene na moglmara suna meglko, na ama ene meglmara suna moglka i, ene pre kan eraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Na ka tau duglo bolo diga i, yoba ta prisre, duglo borabuka i, yoba i dem muduo narukwa. Te, yoba ta dem muduo narukwa i, na Nina yoba i dem muduo tenabuka. Tenan, na ama siragl mere moglka i, yoba i obuno di tenaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Ana Jisas yegl di kodugo, Judas ta, ye Judas Iskariot moglkrukwa i, Jisas di pre, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, Siragl mabuno pre ene no keme obuno di norsre, yoba mudu pra pra obuno di tekratne? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yoba kane suo mere yegl meglkwa. Ta dem muduo narabuka i, na ka diga i, ama duglo borabuka. Yegl eran, na Nina yoba i dem muduo tenan, na Nina bogl akie yoba i moglmara udre, ye moglmara suna mogl tenabuglka. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Yoba ta dem muduo narekrukwa i, na ka diga i, duglo boglkrabuka. Prio. Na ka diga prikwa i, i na kana manugwa ba na Nina na dedugwa i, ye kamo pamiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Na ene bogl akie munga igne i ka tau mere ene di teiga. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ba ka mudu pre ikne edenaiglkwa pre na Nina ene Ake Ple Dinabuka yagle, Mudu Murubuglo ikra, na kagna mina dedenabuka. Mudu Murubuglo dedenan, ye ka pra pra di pogl si tedre, ka mudu di teiga i, pre ikne edinaiglmedi erabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Na ene deno muduno wida dinabedi ersre, ene kodinaglka. Te, na ene deno muduno wida dinabedi tenaglka i, makandigle yoba swara ta tekrimere ene deno muduno wida dinabedi tenaglka. Yegl pre ene deno muduno mina pre yubun dedre, kudugl goglkrio dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Na ka erme ta diga i, Na pidre, okuo ede ikne u ene meglmara unaluwe ka diga i, prisre, ene deno muduno narima, na Nina moglmara enaglka i, ene gun yeigo. I siragl pre Na Nina wakai kaima mogl, na i atne edugwa. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Te, taragl i, na moglmara plau dikrukwa igne, tabre di teiga. Yegl pre plau dinan, ene pre medraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Makadigle yoba bitno moglkwa ikra, tabre kana unagledi erukwa pre nono ka kanana ta dikramga. Ba ye yobuglo ta ere naran, kuno ta erekrabuka. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Te, yoba uglo koglo koglo na Nina dena muduna teiga i, pre pogl sinaiglmedi na Nina kamo pamere duglo boglka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">Ana ene adigl ede wio. Nono ede enamniwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ye ede wain mere yegl mole dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na ede wain mere yegl moglko, na Nina ede wain sugl baglkwa yagl mere yegl moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Na ede wain moglka i, na moglmara, yogagle ta mogo koglkrabuka i, na Nina bagl, i eglke ede enabuka. Te, yogagle ta mogo koglkwa i, ye mogo tau mere korabedi bagl, ere wakai erukwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Ana na ka di teimara i, ene pre igwa pre ye ene bagl ere wakai ere kodugo, ene deglbi yeikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Ene na moglmara si dakagl molo. Ene yegl eribi, na ama ene meglmara si dakagl moraglka. Ede wain yogagle ta yene pere panan, mogo ta koglkrabuka ba ede mabuno mina si dakagl panan keme mogo korabuka. Kuno yegl mere, ene enene mogo ta koglkraiglkwa ba na moglmara si dakagl meglbi keme, mogo koraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Grape vine on trellis" file="HK00112b.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="15.5" />Na ede wain mere yegl moglko, ene wain yogagle mere yegl meglkwa. Na bogl si dakagl meglbi, ene mogo mere koraiglkwa. I siragl pre na mina si dakagl moglkribi, ene taragl swara ta erekraiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Yoba ta na bogl si dakagl moglkran, yoba ede yogagle tau boro, i eglke edimere yegl, na Nina ye i eglke edenabuka. Te, yoba ede yogagle tau i eglke edigwa i, gigle goglko, ye ake i swara ede, i pi doga edidre, gaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Ene na mina meglbi, na kana ene mina yenan, God di praiglmere mere ene ere tenabuka. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Te, ene mogo mere keglkwa igne, na duglo beglkwa yoba kaima meglkwa. Ene erimara i mina na Nina kagie kade yumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Na Nina dem muduo narumere yegl, na ama ene dena muduna teiga. Te, dena mudna teimara i mina atne mogl paio. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Na Nina kamo duglo boglsre, ye dem muduo narumara i mina atne mogl paimere yegl, Ene na dena mudna tenaglmara atne mogl panaiglkwa i, na kana duglo beglbi, atne panaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Na ene ka yegl di teiga i, Na gun yeimere mere yegl ene mina yedre, gun mabuno si kau si tenabedi prika.<verse eid="JHN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Na ene ka ta duglo boraiglme di teiga i, Na ene dena muduna teimere yegl, ene ama agrama abarama deno muduno teo diga. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Ana yoba kabagle ta ere inagledi goran, ye deno muduno teigwa mabuno i, mudu egre i atne kaima edenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Na ene ka ta duglo boraiglmedi teiga i, duglo beglbi, ene na kabaglena moraiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Na okna ene nigl kogon yoba meglme diga ba okuo yegl ta dikraglka. I siragl pre nigl kogon yoba meglkwa i, ye bitno yoba nomanemo i pre pogl sikrikwa. Ba na Nina ka mudu di narukwa i, na ene di nogugl ede teiga pre erme na ene nigl kogon yoba meglme dikre, ene na kabaglena meglmiwe dinaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Ene na ta kere ikrikwa ba nana ene kere iga. Ene pi mogo keglbi, aimadi panabedi pre ene kere iga. Na ene kere iga i, na kagna mina ene siragl ta inamnedi Nina di praiglkwa i, tenabuka. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Na ene ka ta duglo boraiglmedi teiga i, ene ikne ikne deno muduno teo di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makandigle yoba ye Jisas duglo beglkwa yobama kide kanaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />Makandigle yoba ene kide kanibi, ye komono kana na kide kanimedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Te, ene ama makandigle yoba meglma, makandigle yoba i, no swara munedi kandre, ene deno muduno teigo. Ba ene mogl pere edenaiglmedi na ene kere igo, ene makandigle yoba bogl swara moglkrikwa pre makandigle yoba ene kide kanigwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Yoba na ere kide ere naribi, ene ama ere kide ere tenaiglkwa. Ene okna di teiga i pre ikne edenaiglkwa. Na yegl diga, Nigl kogon yoba ta mogl mitna ede, ye yaglmo kade egre atne edekrabe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 13.16</char></note> diga. Te, yoba na kana duglo beglkwa panan, ye ene kano ama duglo boraiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ba ene na yobanama meglkwa pre makandigle yoba mabuno kide kane kane ene ere tenaiglkwa i, Yoba ta na dedugwa i, ye pre kan erekrikwa pre ene ere kide ere tenaiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na u, makandigle yoba ka di tekria, ye tadaglmeno ta paikruko, ba na ye ka di teiga pre ye ere mogl, No tadaglme ta erumga i, ta prikune dibi, kuno ta erekrabuka. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23-24" />Yoba pere ta kogon erekrimere yegl na yoba gumuglno mina erika i, ta erekria, ye tadaglmeno ta paikruko. Ba erme ye na kogon erika i gumuglno mina kandre, na kide kan, na Nina ama kide kanigwa pre tadaglmeno paugwa. Yoba ta na kide kanugwa i, ye na Nina ama kide kanugwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:23-24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ba ye yegl erikwa i, ka ta ye lono mina okna beglkwa i, pai inabuka pre erikwa. Ka i, yegl paugwa, Mem ta paikrumara ye na kide kanigwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 35.19, 69.4</char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Jisas yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na Nina moglmara pidre, Mudu Murubuglo, ye ka kaima i nogugl edugwa i, dedibo, ye na Nina moglmara mogl udre, ye na kana ene obuno di tenabuka. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Te, na kogon mabuno bogl erika igne ede u erme pra, nono akie munga pre ene ama na kana i pi yoba obuno di tenaiglmiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Na ene ka di te moglka i, ene yage si dinaiglkwa pre diga. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Juda yoba ka mabuno yugu makai simara i, ene si meda edinaiglkwa. Te, ege ta okuo yenan, yoba ta ene si geglbi, i ama God kogonmo ere tomnedi praiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Ye na Nina ya na ama pre kan erekrikwa pre mabuno yegl ere tenaiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ba ye mabuno kide yegl ere tenaiglkwa igne, ene poglo di praiglkwa i, Jisas okna di norumere kra plau dumiwe di, prisre, yage sikraiglkwa pre diga. Na okna akie munga pre dinaglka mem wakai ta paikrukwa ba erme ede enaglka paugwa pre ene di pogl teiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Mudu Murubuglo dedenabuka pre dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Ba Nina na dedugwa moglmara ede ikne enagledi erika i, na ede aglo mere enaglka i, ene kira ta pogl narekrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Ba ede enagle diga i pre ene deno muduno kaima yubun podo dogwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Yubun di prikwa ba na ene ka kaima di teiga, na enaglmara i pre ene mina wakai panabuka. Na ta pikribo, Ake Ple Yoba ene meglmara ta ukrabuka ba na ede ebo, ene meglmara unabedi dedenaluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Ana God Murubuglomo unabe diga i, unabuka igne, yoba mabuno suota pre pogl sinaiglmedi i nogugl ede tenabuka. Ye tadaglme mabuno ya te, yoba du moraiglkwa i ya te, God kotmo unabere i, i nogugl ede tenabuka. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Tadaglme mabuno i, yoba na we di pre mediglkrikwa pre tadaglme erikwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Te, mabuno du i, na Nina moglmara ebo, na ta kankraiglkwa pre du moraiglkwa kuno erabuka. <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />Te, God kotmo i, makadigle bitno moglkwa yagl kot mina yage si kodugwa pre God ka tage tenabuka. Tedre, yoba mudu ama ka tage tenabuka. Mudu Murubuglo udre, mem suota i, i nogugl ede tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />Na ka tau mere ama ene di tenagledi prika ba ene erme pre inaiglkwa kuno erekrabuka. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Kuno erekrabuka ba God Murubuglomo, ka kaima mabuno i nogugl edugwa Murubuglo ikra unan, ene mem kaima mudu pre pogl sinaiglmedi erabuka. I siragl pre ye yene prumere ta dikrabuka ba na Nina dugo, prumere i keme didre, taragl okuo plau dinabuka i ene di tenabuka. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Di tenabuka i, na kana idre, ene i nogugl ede tenabuka pre na ama kagna kade narabuka. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Na Nina taraglmo mudu na pre yogwa. Mem swara i pre Mudu Murubuglo na kana idre, ene i nogugl ede tenabe diga ikra, kuno erumiwe di, Jisas ka yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba okuo gun podo yenaiglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Ana Jisas ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Ene kuri ta mogl, na ta kankraiglkwa. Ba okuo kuri kaima ta mogl, na aglke kor dagl kanaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Jisas yegl dugo, duglo beglkwa yagl tau di ikne ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ye ka yegl dugwa i, Kuri ta mogl, na ta kankraiglkwa ba okuo kuri kaima ta mogl, na aglke kor dagl kanaiglme dugwa i, siragl pre dume? Te, Na ede Nina moglmara eiwe dugwa i, ama siragl pre dume? digwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Yegl didre, ama yegl di prikwa, Ye kuri ta we dugwa i, mem siragl paugo, dume? Nono pre kan erekrumniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Ka kira yegl poramnedi Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl nomane mina prikwa i, Jisas pre kan kodo, yegl dugwa, Na ka ta diga i, Ene kuri ta mogl, na ta kankraiglkwa ba okuo ene kuri ta mogl, aglke kor dagl na kanaiglme diga i pre mem pre pogl sinamnedi dimo? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Na erme ene ka kaima ta di tenaglka i, Ene kai ersre, mitna podo goraiglkwa ba makandigle yoba gun yenaiglkwa. Ene deno muduno yubun denabuka ba okuo ene gun podo kaima yenaiglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Abu ta gak kuragledi erukwa igne, ye egemo umedi prisre, giugl pre dinagledi prukwa pre ye dem muduo yubun dogwa. Ba ye gak kugl kodugwa igne, ye gun yedre, giugl siragl mere prukwa i, kiurukwa. I siragl pre yoba kor ta makandigle umedi prisre, gun yogwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Okuo kuri ta mogl, gun podo yomere mere yegl, ene deno muduno erme yubun dogwa ba na aglke kor dagl ene kanaglka igne, ene deno muduno mina gun podo yenaiglkwa. Te, ene gun yenaiglkwa i, yoba swara ta i eglke edekrabiwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Ege okuo i, ene ka kira swara ta na pogl prikraiglkwa ba ene na kagna mina ka siragl mere na Nina di praiglkwa i, ye ene dinaiglmere ere tenabuka. I ka kaima diga. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Okna ede u erme ugwa i, ene na kagna mina taragl swara ta inamnedi agle di prikrikwa. Ba erme agle di pribi, inaiglkwa. Ene ibi, gun mabuno i, ene meglmara si kau si tenabiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas makandigle mabuno yobuglo ere te kodiwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Ana Jisas ka yegl didre, ka ta ama yegl dugwa, Na ka erme di teiga i, ka ebrie keme ene di teiga ba ege ta okuo yenan, na Nina kamo ene nogugl kaima di tenaglka. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Ege i ene na kagna mina agle di praiglkwa ba dibi, ene kano kep ta erekraglka. <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />I siragl pre na Nina ene dem muduo podo togwa pre kano prabuka. Ene na Nina moglmara mogl umedi pre mediglsre, deno muduno narikwa pre na Nina dem muduo podo ene togwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Na Nina moglmara mogl umedi pre mediglkwa i, kaima na Nina bogl muglka ede makadigle wiga. Aglke erme makadigle kide kodo, ede Nina moglmara enaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl yegl digwa, Ana erme i, ka ebrie dikre, ka mogo nogugl di notniwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />No erme kamga i, yoba nomane mina prikwa i, ene pre kan kodinga pre ene ka kira pogl praiglkwa i ta paikrukwa. No yegl kandre, ene God moglmara mogl, unedi pre meduniwe digwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl yegl digo, Jisas di ikne ede, Ene erme keme pre mediglmo? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Ene prio. Ege ta u kodugwa ene mudu na kide kodo, ede pere pere pi, teke ede ikne yugunomugl ebi, na swara moraglka. Na kodinaiglkwa ba na Nina bogl akie mogl pai morabuglka.<verse eid="JHN 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Na ka erme di teiga i, mudu ene na mina si dakagl moglsre, deno muduno wida di inaiglkwa pre diga. Ene makandigle moraiglmara i, yoba yubun kane kane tenaiglkwa ba ene gun yeio! Na makandigle yoba yobuglo ere te kodiwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl pre kamage erukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodidre, kan heven ibo ede, yegl dugwa, Nina yo, ege ta unabuka i, u kodumiwa. Ene kagna kade natn, na ama ene kagn kade tenaglka. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Ene yoba mudu bitno moratnedi yobuglo natnga i, na ta eraglmara i mina yoba ira ta natnga i, ye aimadi kamun kor moraiglkwa pre natnga. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Te, yoba aimadi kamun kor moraiglkwa i, mem yegl paugwa, ene swara God kaima motnga i, pre kan ersre, na Jisas Krais, ene dedinga i, ama pre kan eraiglkwa mem yegl pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Kogon makandigle natnere i, mudu ere kodidre, kagn kade teiga. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Aglke erme we, dumo makan yeikrukwa igne, nono kagno kade pamere mere yegl, aglke kor panabedi ero dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Ene makadigle yoba meglmara yoba tau natnga i, ene motnere di nogugl ede te kodiga. Yoba i, ene yobanma meglko, ene na natngo, ye ene kanen duglo beglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Duglo boglsre, erme pre kan erikwa i, ene ka mudu natnga i, ene mina swara yedre, umedi pre kan erikwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Te, ene ka di natnga i, na yoba i di teigo, ye pre igwa. Ye pre igwa i, Na ene bogl akie muglko, ene na dedugo, umedi pre mediglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Na kamage erika i, yoba i ake ple di tenatnedi kamage erika. Makandigle yoba mudu pre ta kamage erekrika ba yoba ta kere i natnga i keme pre kamage erika. I siragl pre ye ene yobanma meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Na yobanama ta meglkwa i, ye mudu ene yobanma meglko, te ene yobanma mudu na yobanama meglkwa. Te, yoba i mina na kagna kade iwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Na erme makandigle moglkre, ene motnara unaglka ba na duglo beglkwa yoba i, makandigle mogl pai moraiglkwa. Nina, ene i tade motniwa. Yoba i ene kagn mina suglno moratnedi prika. Ene kagn kade paugwa natnga i mina nono swara kaima muglere yegl, ye swara kaima moraiglmedi suglno moratnedi prika. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Yoba i bogl akie wan munga igne, na ene kagn pai kawa togwa natnga i mina na ye sugl kan moglka. Ye sugl kan moglko, ye swara ta wau boglkriko, wau borabuka yobamo i keme wau boglkwa. Ye wau boglkwa i, ene kanen pai inabedi pre wau boglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Erme na ene motnara unaglka ba na ye bogl makadigle wan munara ka mere beke teiga i, na gun yeimere mere ye meglmara ama kau si tenabedi priwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Na ene kanen yoba i di teigo, makandigle yoba ye kide kanigwa. Na makandigle yoba moglkrimere mere yegl, na yobanama i, ama makandigle yoba moglkrikwa pre ye kide kanigwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Na ye pre ene agle di prika i, ene ye makandigle mogl dinaiglmedi i pi dumo bage ta edinatnga pre ta dikrika ba ene ye suglno motn, yagl kide ere kide ere te dinabuka pre diga. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Na makandigle yoba moglkrimere yegl, ye ama makandigle yoba moglkrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Enene kanen kaima paugwa. Kanen kaima i mina ye ene pre moraiglmedi i pere edo dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ene na dedingo, ede makandigle wimere yegl, na yobanama i, ede dumo uglo koglo koglo enaiglmedi dediga. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Te, na mogl pere ede kogonen erika i, ye ama ene kogonen kaima paugwa i, mogl pere ede eraiglkwa pre erika.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ye yoba okuo pre medraiglkwa pre kamage erukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Ana Jisas kamage yegl ere kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Na duglo beglkwa yoba magigl meglkwa i keme pre kamage erekrika ba na kana dibi, yoba ira ta pre medraiglkwa i pre ama kamage erika. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nina yo, na ye pre kamage erika i, nono swara kaima muglere yegl mere ye ama swara yegl moraiglmedi prika. Na ene motnara suna moglko, ene na moglmara suna motnga. Ye nono muglara suna meglbi, makandigle yoba kandre, ene na dedumedi pre medraiglmedi priwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nono swara muglere yegl, ye swara kaima moraiglmedi prika. Prisre, na kagna kade natnga i, ye ama teiga. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Te, ene na moglmara suna motngo, na ye meglmara suna moglka i, ye swara kaima moraiglkwa pre erubuglka. Ye swara kaima meglbi, makandigle yoba kandre, ene na dedinedi pre medraiglkwa. Te, ene den mudun nare, na dedingo wimere i, makadigle yoba ama ene den mudun na duglo beglkwa yoba teniwe di praiglmedi priwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />Nina yo, ene yoba ta natnga i, na moglmara bogl akie mun, na abuglagna ya kagna kade natnga ikra kanaiglmedi prika. Kagna kade natnga i, dumo makan yeikrukwa igne, ene den mudun podo natnga pre natnga.<verse eid="JHN 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Nina yagl du kaima, na ene pre kan erika ba makandigle yoba ene ta pre kan erekrikwa. Pre kan erekrikwa ba na yobanama magigl meglkwa i, ye ene na dedinedi pre kan erikwa. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Te, ene motnere di nogugl ede teiga i, aimadi di nogugl ede te pai moraglka. Na yegl eribo, na ene den mudun natnere mere yegl ye ama meglmara suna yenabuka. Yenan, na ye meglmara ama suna mogl tenagledi priwe di, Jisas kamage ere, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Judas ye Jisas kudamo ikne auro yugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matyu 26.47-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mak 14.43-50</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Ana Jisas ka yegl di kodugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl ede taun meda pidre, nigl kebra ta Kidron we dimara ede koglo eigwa. Ede koglo pidre, dumo ta yoba ede oliv ere yaiglmara ede suna eigwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Te, dumo i, Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl okna ege mere makai simara pre Judas, Jisas i pi kudamo ikne ogono mina yenabuka yaglmo i, dumo i ama pre kan ersre, <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" /><figure style="fig" alt="Jesus arrested" file="FM 182 Betrayal and Arrest_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="18.3">Lotu bitno yoba Jisas si kane sigwa</figure>ye ere mogl, soldia, ya tawa teigwa yoba kibr nem meglkwa i, ye auro i ede dumo i ogwa. Kibr nem i, Farisi ya tawa teigwa bitno yoba Judas bogl pio digo, eigwa. Pidre, ye ken lam ya ken idre, kuda taragl idre, ede eigwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yegl eriko, Jisas siragl taragl ye moglmara plau dinabuka i pre kan ere kodidre, yoba wigwa i tegigl yedre, ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene ira dokime? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Jisas Nasaret nem moglkwa ikra, ye dokumniwe digwa. Te, yagl Judas kudamo ikne ogono mina yenabuka i, bogl akie adigl meglkwa. Yegl digo, Jisas ye di tedre, Na Moluwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ana Jisas ye Na Moluwe dugo, yoba wigwa i prikwa igne, ye mogl eglke edidre, yage makandigle sigwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Ana yage makandigle sigo, Jisas aglke kor ye di pre, Ene ira dokime? dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, Jisas Nasaret nem moglkwa ikra, ye dokumniwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yegl digo, Jisas aglke kor yegl dugwa, Na yagl i moliwe di, ene di te kodiga. Yegl pre ene na dokigwa panan, yoba tau na bogl akie meglkwa i, kanige erio dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Jisas ka yegl dugwa i, ye ka ta okna dugwa i pai inabedi pre dugwa. Ye ka ta okna dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Ene yoba tau natnga i, suglno moglko, swara ta wau boglkrume<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon 17.12</char></note> dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Ana Saimon Pita ye bainet ta paduglkwa i, i meda edidre, yagl ta kina wo kra paugwa i, si keglu sugwa. Yagl i kagie Malkus we digwa, ye tawa teigwa bitno yoba niglno kogono yoba ta moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Ana Pita yegl eruko, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene bainet aglke kor paus mina edo! Na Nina nigl ta kogl narukwa i, na ta nedre, ibun ikraglo? di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ye Jisas si kane si i pi Anas moglmara edigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Ana soldia tau ye bitno yagl bogl yeigo, Juda yoba kibr nem tau dedigwa i yeigo, ye Jisas si akidre, ye si kane sigwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Ye si kane sidre, komono kana ye i pi yagl ta Anas we digwa i moglmara edigwa. Anas ye Kaiafas bawamo moglkwa. Te, Kaiafas, ye bugla yugu igne i tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Kaiafas i, ye okna Juda yoba di togwa i, Israel yoba mudu ta wau bogl dinaiglmedi, yoba swara ta ye pre goran, wakai panabiwe dugwa ikra moglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Jisas pre kan erekriwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matyu 26.69-70</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mak 14.66-68</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22.55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Ana ye Jisas si kane si ede eigwa igne, Saimon Pita ya Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta bogl ye duglo bogl ede ebrika. Ana duglo boglkwa yagl ta akie ebrika ikra, tawa teigwa bitno yagl moglkwa i, ye guma dra kanugwa pre yagl i swara Jisas duglo bogl ede pi bitno yagl kipamara ede togl suna ogwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Ye ede togl suna ogwa ba Pita togl dra meda adigl moglkwa. Ye meda adigl moglkwa pre Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta bitno yagl guma dra kanugwa i, ede meda u abai ta togl dra sugl moglkwa i, ka di tedre, Pita agre i ede togl suna ogwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Ubriko, nigl kogon abai togl dra sugl moglkwa i, Pita di te, yegl dugwa, Ene yagl i duglo beglkwa yagl meglmara suna i, motnkana we dugwa. Yegl dugo, Pita di ikne ede, Na ta moglkriwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Ana togl suna i, nigl kogon yoba ya kibr nem meglkwa i, ir erukwa pre ede ere gagl, pre meglkwa. Yegl ere meglmara Pita ede suna ogo, ye akie adigl mogl, ede pre meglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda yoba kade Jisas kot ere teigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matyu 26.59-66</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mak 14.55-64</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22.66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus before Caiaphas" file="FM 183 Jesus Before Caiaphas_6inches_BW.jpg" size="col" copy="Foundation Matters" ref="18.19" />Ana igne i tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, ye Jisas duglo beglkwa yoba siragl mere meglkwa i pre Jisas kira pogl prisre, Jisas ka siragl mere yoba beke togwa i pre ama kira pogl prukwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Di pruko, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na yoba mudu ka nogugl keme di tedre, ege ege yoba ka mabuno yugu kei yeimara ya tawa teigwa yugu yomara moglsre, yoba ka beke teiga. Na atne teke ta mogl, ka swara ta dikrika. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Yegl pre siragl eruko, ene kira mere pogl natne? Na ka siragl mere diga i, yoba tau prikwa i di pro! Na ka siragl mere diga i, ye pre kan erimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Ana Jisas yegl dugo, kibr nem swara ta magigl adigl moglkwa i, Jisas agl dage sidre, yegl dugwa, Tawa teigwa yoba bitno moglkwa i, ene ka yegl mere di ikne ede tenatnga kuno erumo? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na ka kide ta diga panan, ene na ka kide siragl mere diga i, di nogugl edo. Ba na ka wakai ta diga panan, ene siragl pre na sine? dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Ana Jisas kane sigwa i, pai moglko, Anas ye Jisas i pi tawa teigwa yoba bitno yagl, Kaiafas i, moglmara edinaiglmedi dedugo, ede eigwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita aglke kor Jisas pre kan erekriwe dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matyu 26.71-75</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mak 14.69-72</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22.58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Ana Pita adigl moglsre, ede pre moglko, yoba tau ye yegl di prikwa, Ene ama yagl i duglo beglkwa yoba meglmara suna motnkana digwa. Yegl digo, Pita mane didre, Na ta moglkriwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Ana tawa teigwa bitno moglkwa i, niglmo kogonmo yagl ta mogl, Pita kira pogl prukwa. Yagl i Pita yagl ta kina si bugl di edugwa i, bormai swara miurka ta moglkwa. Ye Pita yegl di prukwa, Ede oliv ere yaiglmara na ene Jisas bogl akie miurko, kanie di priwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Yegl dugo, Pita aglke kor, Na ta manumiwe dugo, koduwagle kumugl swara ta tabre kaima wi sugwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas agre i pi, Pailat moglmara eigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matyu 27.1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">27.11-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mak 15.1-5</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Ana kamun tagna kide mogl, Juda yoba kade wagle Kaiafas kipamara kide kodidre, ede Rom gavana kipamara enamnedi Jisas auro ede edigwa. Ye Jisas i pi teigwa ba ye togl suna pikrikwa. Ye suna enaiglkwa i, ye Juda yoba moglkrikwa pre ye yene si deglbi yenaiglkwa. Si deglbi yebi, God nono kowano awano oglo sugwa pre kaya mokna nenamga i, ta nekramga pamedi prisre, togl meda meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Togl meda meglkwa pre Pailat ye ede meda u ye meglmara udre, yegl dugwa, Yagl i siragl aglau erukwa pre ye kot ere tenamnedi prime? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Ye mabuno kide ta erekruma, ye ta yu ene motnara ukrumgo we digwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Ana Juda yoba kade wagle yegl digo, Pailat ye di te, yegl dugwa, Enene ye i pi ene lono mina kot ere te, praiglmere erio dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye di ikne ede, No yoba ta kot ere tedre, si goramga i, ene Rom yoba mane dimiwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Ana ye ka dimara i mina Jisas okna siragl mere goragle di paduglmere ikra pai yugwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Ana Pailat aglke kor ye yugumo toglmo ede suna pidre, Jisas agle dugo, ugwa. Ugo, Pailat ye di pre yegl dugwa, Ene Juda yoba kingno motno? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, Dinga i, enene pitnere dino mo yoba na yegl moglme digo, dine? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Dugo, Pailat di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na Juda moglmedi pitno? Enene yugobunonen, Juda yoba ya tawa teigwa bitno yoba ene kot ere tenatnedi yu na moglmara edigwa. Ene siragl mabuno etne? dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, Na king moglsre, yoba suglno moglka i, makandigle igle ta yeikrukwa. Igle ta yoma, na niglna kogona yoba kudana erima, Juda yoba na si kane sikriko. Ba erme na king moglsre, sugl moraglka dumo i, makandigle i ta yeikrumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Jisas yegl dugo, Pailat ye di pre, Ene dinga i, kaima king ta moglnga pre dino? dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, Ene dinga i, kuno diniwa. Na mana kugl yogo, ede makandigle wiga i, ka mem kaima paugwa i, di nogugl ede tenagledi wiga. Yoba ta mabuno kaima duglo boramnedi erikwa i, mudu na kana primiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Dugo, Pailat ye di te, Ka kaima we dinga i, i siragl ne? dugwa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Jisas si goglsre, yagl kide Barabas i meda ede noro digwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matyu 27.15-26</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mak 15.6-15</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Ana Pailat ka yegl di kodidre, aglke ede meda pi Juda yoba meglmara pidre, ye yegl di togwa, Na yagl i aglau ta erekrumedi kaniga. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ba ene mabuno ta bogl, bogl erikwa i, God ene kowano awano oglo sugwa ege, ene kane yoba paigwa i, swarano ta i meda ede noro digo, te, te, erika. Yegl pre ene siragl we di prime? Na ene Juda yoba kingno i meda edibo, wakai praiglmo? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Pailat yegl dugo, Juda yoba aglke kor ka podo didre, Yagl i, i meda ede norokro! Yagl ta Barabas we digwa i, i meda ede noro! digwa. Yagl Barabas i, ye kunogl gogl yoba ta moglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">Pailat yoba kano prisre, Jisas i pi si golo dugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matyu 27.27-31</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mak 15.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Ana Pailat ye soldia wagle di te, Jisas i pi duglnai sio dugo, ye i pi duglnai sigwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Soldia wagle Jisas duglnai sidre, ama kewan kagigle ake kegmane ere, king bitno gagl erimere yegl ye bre mina padigl tedre, gagl suna gogl ta ede teigwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Yegl ersre, ye moglmara u yegl digwa, Juda yoba kingno, no ene di wakai yei tomniwe didre, ye agl dage sigwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Ana Pailat aglke kor dagl ede meda pi yoba yegl di togwa, Na yagl i, yu obuno dibo, kanaiglkwa. Ba ye aglaumo ta paikrumedi kaniwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Ana Pailat yegl dugo, Jisas kan kagigle bre mina yobiglkwa ya gagl suna gogl ede teigwa pai miurko, ede meda ugwa. Ede meda ugo, Pailat yegl dugwa, Yagl ikra uma, kanio! dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Ana Jisas ede meda ugo, tawa teigwa bitno meglkwa yeigo, kibr nem ye sugl meglkwa i ama yeigo, kanigwa igne, ye ka podo di, yegl digwa, Ye ede prak mina si goglo! Ede prak mina si goglo! digwa. Yegl digo, Pailat aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ye ede prak mina si goramendi pribi, enene ye i pi si goraiglkwa paugwa. Ye aglau ta erekrumedi kaniwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Pailat yegl dugo, Juda yoba kade wagle di ikne ede, No lono ta paugwa i, lo i mina yagl i gorabuka keme paugwa. I siragl pre ye God Wam moluwe dumiwe di, Juda yoba yegl digwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Ana Juda yoba ye God Wam mole dume digo, Pailat prukwa igne, ye Jisas kuduglmo goglkwa i, u podo ogwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Kudugl goglsre, aglke kor yugumo toglmo pidre, Jisas di pre, yegl dugwa, Ene aglo mogl une? dugwa. Yegl dugwa ba Jisas ka swara ta di ikne edekrukwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Di ikne edekruko, Pailat aglke kor yegl dugwa, Ene ka ta di ikne edekratno? Na ene i meda edenaglka mo ede prak mina si goraglka i, na mina paugwa. Mo, i ta pre kan erekitno? dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yegl dugo, Jisas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, God mogl mitna edugwa i, ene namba ta tekruma, ene taragl swara ta ere narekitngo. Yegl paugwa pre ene tadaglmenen kebra paugwa ba yoba ta na ene ogon mina edugwa i, tadaglmemo podo kaima pamiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Jisas yegl dugo, Pailat prisre, ye i meda edenagledi konbo dokugwa ba Juda yoba kade wagle ka podo yegl digwa, Ene yagl i, i meda edin, ene Rom King kabaglemo ta moglkitnga paugwa. I siragl pre yoba ta king mole dugwa i, ye ka dumara i, Rom King kudamo ikne mere yegl moglmiwe digwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Ana Pailat ka i prisre, Jisas auro yudre, ye jas siamo yu agai ta yomara yedre, ame dugwa. Agai i, ye Kobuglo Makandigle Padiglmara we digwa. Te, ka Hibru mina, agai i Gabata we digwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Ana ade kwie belo yogo, ege i God Israel yoba oglo sugwa ege yenabuka pre taragl tau ake kun ere meglkwa. Ana Pailat Juda yoba yegl di togwa, Ene kanio, ene kingno moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Yegl dugo, Juda yoba i, ka podo yegl digwa, I ede po! Ye ede prak mina si goglo! digwa. Yegl digo, Pailat di ikne ede, Na ene kingno ede prak mina si goraglo? dugwa. Yegl dugo, tawa teigwa yoba bitno meglkwa i di ikne ede, yegl digwa, Rom King moglkwa i, ye swara no kingno moglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Yegl digo, Pailat ye Jisas ede prak mina si goraiglmedi ye te ogono mina edugwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede prak mina sigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matyu 27.32-44</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mak 15.21-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Crucifixion" file="CN01836B.TIF" size="span" copy="David C Cook" ref="19.17" />Ana yoba tau Jisas auro i ede meda eigo, Jisas yene ede prakmo kake idre, ede pi dumo ta Bre Yobuglo dumo we dimara ogwa. Dumo i, ka Hibru mina Golgota we digwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Dumo i, ye Jisas ede prak mina si padiglsre, yagl suo ama ta akie ede prak mina si padiglkwa. Yagl ta Jisas ogo wo kra paugo, ta ogo koda kra paugo, Jisas suna paugwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Ana Pailat ere mogl, ka ta bogl paduglko, ye i pi ede prak mina padiglkwa. Ye ka boglkwa i, yegl boglkwa, I Jisas, Nasaret nem moglkwa. Ye Juda yoba kingno moglmiwe di, yegl boglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ana ye Jisas ede prak mina sigwa i, taun yomara magigl yogwa pre Juda yoba tau mere ka i kerikwa. Te, ye ka boglkwa i, ka Hibru mina boglsre, ka Rom mina boglsre, ka Grik mina ama boglkwa pre mere kerikwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Ana Tawa teigwa bitno meglkwa i, ede Pailat moglmara udre, yegl digwa, Ene yagl i Juda yoba kingno moglmiwe di, yegl boglkro. Ba ene boratnga i, Yagl i ye Juda yoba kingno moluwe dume di, yegl boratniwe digwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Yegl digo, Pailat di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na boglmere keme pai morabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Ana soldia wagle ye Jisas ede prak mina si padiglsre, ye kuguglmo gaglmo tau idre, br 4-pela boglsre, swara swarade igwa. Swara swarade igo, ye gaglmo suna pai moglkwa kanigwa i, lap si beglmere mere yegl ta yeikrukwa ba yene gagl mudu ta yogwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Yegl kanigwa pre yegl digwa, Nono gagl suna i, ake argla dikramga paugwa ba kas mere yegl sumun, yoba ta win sinabuka i, inabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 22.18</char></note> digwa. Yegl dimara i, God kamo okna ta beglkwa i, pai yugwa. Ka i yegl beglkwa, Ye na kuguglna gaglna yubu sidre, ira ta inabedi kas mere yegl simiwe di, yegl beglkwa. Beglkwa pamere soldia wagle kuno yegl erikwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Ana Jisas ede prak mina pai moglmara i, abu tau magigl adigl meglkwa. Ye mam yogo, mam abauglo ama yogo, Maria ye Klopa ebie moglkwa i yogo, Maria ta dumo Makdala mam moglkwa i bogl akie adigl meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Ana Jisas ye mam magigl moglkwa i kandre, ye duglo boglkwa yagl ta wakai kanugwa i ama magigl adigl moglkwa i kandre, ye mam yegl di togwa, Abu yo, kano, yagl i ene wan moglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Yegl didre, ye duglo boglkwa yagl i yegl di togwa, Kano, abu i, ene man moglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, mokomugl i, ye duglo boglkwa yagl i, Jisas mam yu ye yugumo mina edidre, suglmo moglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas goglkwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matyu 27.45-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mak 15.33-41</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Ana okuo Jisas prukwa i, Erme kogona mudu dudumedi prisre, God kamo bage ta beglkwa i pai inabedi yegl dugwa, Na nigl goluwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 22.15</char></note> dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Ana nigl migi ta magigl yogwa i, wain ku erukwa nigl migi mina atne moglkwa pre yoba ta ere mogl, giagin idre, ede hisop yogagle mina were, wain ku erukwa nuglo moglmara i, si badre, Jisas nenabedi togo, nogwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Ana Jisas wain nuglo ku erukwa i nedre, yegl dugwa, I pra dudumiwe dugwa. Yegl didre, bre magi didre, goglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Soldia ta kuglage idre, Jisas dagigle mina sugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Ana ege i, wakan kade tagna yenabuka pre yoba taragl tau ere wakai erikwa igne yogwa. Te, wakan kade i, ege kade ta yenabuka. Yegl pre Juda yoba kade wagle u, Pailat moglmara udre, ye soldiamo tau di tenan, ye pi, yoba tau ede prak mina pai meglkwa i, kaglno yobuglo si buko dibi, yoba i tabre geglbi, ye i atne edinaiglmedi di prikwa. I siragl pre yoba ogono nagino tau ede prak mina pai moran, wakan kade yenabuka i, ye kide prikwa pre ka yegl digwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Yegl di priko, Pailat pra we dugo, soldia tau u yagl koglo koglo pabrika suo ikra, kaglno yobuglo si buko digwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Yegl erikwa ba ye Jisas pamara u kanigwa i, ye gogl kodumedi kandre, yobuglo swara ta si buko dikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Si buko dikrikwa ba soldia swara ta kuglage idre, Jisas dagigle mina sugwa. Sugo, nigl ya bormai akie tabre ede meda ugwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Ana yoba ta taragl yegl mere gumuglo mina kanugwa i, kandre, ka magigl i boglsre, di nogugl edugwa. Te, ye ka di nogugl ede togwa i, ka kaima dugwa. Ye yene ka kaima die di prisre, te kamo i ene pre medraiglmedi pre dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Ana taragl yegl mere plau dugwa i, God kamo bage ta beglkwa i, pai inabedi pre plau dugwa. Ka beglkwa i, yegl beglkwa, Ye yobuglomo swara ta si buko dikraiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isip Kide Kodigwa 12.46</char></note> di, yegl beglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Te, God kamo bage ta mina yegl beglkwa, Yoba ta ye kuglage mina sigwa yobamo i, ye kanaiglmiwe dugwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sekaraia 12.10</char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ogo nagie i pi kobuglo mur yeigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matyu 27.57-61</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mak 15.42-47</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Ana mokomugl i, yagl ta kagie Josep we digwa, dumo Arimatea nem ta moglkwa ede Pailat moglmara udre, Jisas ogo nagie inagledi di prukwa. Yagl Josep i, ye Jisas kamo duglo boglkwa yoba ta moglkwa ba ye Juda yoba kade wagle kuduglno goglsre, di nogugl edinakirukwa. Ana yagl i Jisas ogo nagie inagledi Pailat di pruko, Pailat pra we dugwa pre ye pi Jisas ogo nagie i atne edugwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Te, Josep ede ogwa igne, Nikodemus ye bogl akie ede ebrika. Nikodemus i, ye yagl ta okna Jisas moglmara eduer ugwa ikra moglkwa. Nikodemus ede nuglo demene erukwa i, suo suru i swara edidre, yugwa. Ede nuglo i, 30 kilogram mere yegl yugwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Ana Josep ya Nikodemus Jisas ogo nagie idre, lap kruo mina were, ede nuglo demene erukwa i egre tedre, padiglkwa. Juda yoba ye yoba maugl sigwa igne, mabuno yegl erikwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Ana ye Jisas ede prak mina simara magigl i, yoba ta kaya mokna ere yaglmara yogwa. Te, dumo i yomara, kobuglo mur kor ta pere yeigwa yogwa. Kobuglo mur i mina yoba goglkwa ege swara ta atne yeikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Ana igne i wakan kade tagna yenabuka pre taragl ere wakai erikwa igne yogwa. Yegl yogo, kobuglo mur i, magigl yogwa pre ye Jisas ogo nagie i mina atne yeigwa.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Jisas adigl u kor ogwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matyu 28.1-8</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mak 16.1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Ana Sande kamun tage kuno erekruko, Maria dumo Makdala mam ikra, ede kobuglo mur pidre, kanugwa i, kobuglo podo maugl dra si kegl digwa i, i eglke ede kodigo, kanugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Kandre, muku di ede pi Saimon Pita ya Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta Jisas wakai kanugwa ikra, di te, yegl dugwa, Yoba tau ede kobuglo mur udre, Yaglno Kade ogo nagie i eglke edidre, aglo mere yeigwa i, na ta kankriwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Ana Maria ka yegl dugo, Pita ya Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta moglkwa i, akie kobuglo mur enabugledi <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />muku dibrika ba Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta moglkwa i, ye tabre muku dugwa pre ye Pita kide kodo, ede okna pi kobuglo mur yomara plau dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Ye plau didre, magi di, kan atne edugwa ba ede yugugl pikrukwa. Ye kan atne edidre, kanugwa i, ye lap kruo mina Jisas ogo nagie werikwa lap i yogo, kanugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Kanugo, Saimon Pita ye mokomugl udre, ede kobuglo mur yugugl pi kanugwa lap kruo ikra yogo, kanugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />Ye lap kruo yogo, kandre, lap ta Jisas bre mina werikwa i ama kuri ta eglke iro yogo, kanugwa. Lap i, yoba ta ake perukwa mere yegl kanugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Ana Pita yegl kanugo, Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta ede okna ugwa i, ama ede yugugl pi kandre, Jisas kaima adigl u kor omedi pre meduglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Igne i, God kamo bage ta Jisas adigl u kor enabe dugwa i, ye prikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Ana Jisas duglo biurka yagl suo i, ye kobuglo mur kan kodidre, aglke ede ikne pi yugugl ta miurara ebrika.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maria, dumo Makdala mam ikra Jisas kanugwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matyu 28.9-10</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mak 16.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Ana Maria ikra, ye kobuglo mur meda adigl mogl, kai ere moglkwa. Ye kai ere mogl, magi didre, kan yugugl ede, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />kanugwa i, angelo suo kugugl gagl kruo edidre, ame di miurko, kanugwa. Angelo ta Jisas bre yeimara ame di moglko, ta kagle yeimara ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Angelo suo i Maria di pre, Abu yo, siragl eruko kai etne? dibrika. Yegl dibriko, Maria di ikne ede, Yoba na Yaglna Kade ogo nagie i pi aglo mere yeigwa i, na ta kankriwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Maria ka yegl didre, kan ake te, Jisas meda adigl moglkwa kanugwa. Ba ye Jisas moglmedi kankrukwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Ana Jisas Maria di pre, yegl dugwa, Abu yo, ene siragl pre kai etne? Ene ira dokine? dugwa. Ana Maria prukwa i, ye gaden sugl moglkwa yagl ta moglmedi prisre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Yagl kade yo, ene ye ogo nagie i pi bage ta edinga panan, ene dumo i di natn, na pi ogo nagie inaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye kagie dagl, Maria we dugwa. Yegl dugo, Maria kan ake tedre, ka Hibru mina Rabonai! we dugwa. Ka Rabonai i, mem paugwa i, Neno Yagle. <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Ana Maria yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, Na kugrokro. Na ede Nina moglmara ibo enaglka i, pai moglkwa. Ba ene ede pi na agrama wagle Jisas yegl dumiwe di to, Na ede pi na Nina ya ene Neno moglmara ede eiga. Te, ye na Godna moglsre, ene Godno ama moglmiwe di, na yegl dumiwe do! dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Jisas yegl dugo, Maria dumo Makdala mam ede pi Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl yegl di togwa, Na Yagl Kade kanigo, ye ka yegl yegl di narumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ye Jisas kanigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matyu 28.16-20</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mak 16.14-18</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Ana Sande min paugo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl i, Juda yoba kade kuduglno goglsre, dua lok sidre, yugugl meglkwa. Yugugl meglko, Jisas u ye meglmara suna adigl moglsre, yegl dugwa, Ene deno muduno wida dinabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Jisas yegl didre, ye ogo ya dagigle kanaiglmedi obuno di togwa. Obuno di togo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i, Yagl Kade kanimara i pre gun yeigwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Jisas ye aglke kor yegl di togwa, Ene deno muduno wida di yenabuka. Na Nina na dedumere yegl, na ene ama dediwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Jisas yegl didre, dra mur pu di ye meglmara edidre, Ene Mudu Murubuglo io dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene yoba ta tadaglmeno kide kodinaiglkwa i, tadaglmeno kaima dudunabuka. Te, ene yoba ta tadaglmeno kide kodokraiglkwa i, ye tadaglmeno kaima pai morabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tomas ye Jisas kanugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Ana Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 12-pela swarano ta Tomas, kagie ta Gak Pikagl we digwa i, Jisas okna ye meglmara plau dugwa igne, moglkrukwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" /><figure style="fig" alt="Thomas and Jesus" file="cn01871b.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="20.25" />Yegl pre Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl ye di tedre, No Yagl Kade kanumniwe digwa. Digwa ba Tomas ye yegl di togwa, Nana gumuglna mina ye ogo bro pamara kandre, ake prisre, ya dagigle mina bro pamara i, ama ake pribo keme, ye adigl u kor omedi pre medraglka. Ta manan, na ta pre mediglkraluwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ana ege 8-pela de ede ogo, Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl aglke kor yugugl meglko, Tomas ye meglmara bogl akie meglkwa. Ye yugugl moglsre, dua lok sigwa ba Jisas u ye meglmara suna adigl moglsre, yegl dugwa, Ene deno muduno wida di yenabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Jisas ye yegl didre, Tomas yegl di togwa, Ene u na ogona ake prisre, kano. Te, ene ogon yu dagra ama ake pro. Ene pre mediglkre, motnga i kide kodidre, na pre mediglo dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Dugo, Tomas di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Na Yaglna Kade ya Godna motniwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Dugo, Jisas ka yegl dugwa, Ene na kandre keme pre mediglnga ba yoba ta na kankre, pre medraiglkwa i, God ye ere wakai kaima ere tenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jon ye buk i siragl pre boglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl gumuglno mina kimagl tau mere erukwa i, na mudu pepa magigl i mina ta boglkrika. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Na ye kimagl mudu erukwa i ta boglkrika ba tau boglka i, ene prisre, Jisas ye God Kere Yugwa Yagl moglsre, God Wam moglmedi pre medraiglkwa pre boglka. Te, ene pre mediglbi, ye kagie mina aimadi kamun kor moraiglkwa pre boglka.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl 7-pela meglmara Jisas plau dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus on shore calling disciples in boat" file="cn01876B.tif" size="col" copy="David C Cook" ref="21.1" />Ana okuo Jisas nigl nubun Taiberias bina moglsre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl na kanaiglmedi ye yene obuno dugwa. Ka i yegl mere paugwa, <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Saimon Pita ya Tomas, kagie ta Didimus we digwa i yebriko, Nataniel, distrik Galili dumo Kana suna nem moglkwa i yogo, Sebedi wam suo yebriko, Jisas duglo biurka yagl suo ama ye bogl akie meglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Akie meglko, Saimon Pita ye yegl di togwa, Na pi buglo bagle ere sinaluwe dugwa. Dugo, yagl wagle i di ikne ede, Nono akie ede enamniwe digwa. Didre, ye akie pi baglkugl mina ede nigle suna pidre, ere si wan meglkwa ba ye eduer kogon ere mogl kamun tagigwa i, buglo bagle kaima ta sikrikwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Ana kamun tage ugo, Jisas nigle bina adigl moglko, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i, ye kanigwa ba ye Jisas moglmedi kan pogl sikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Ana Jisas ye di pre, yegl dugwa, Gagrama wagle, ene buglo bagle tau si yuimo? dugwa. Dugo, ye mane digwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Mane digo, Jisas ye di te, yegl dugwa, ene degigl gagl ogono wo kra nigl atne edio. Edibi, ene buglo bagle tau sinaiglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye dumere eriko, buglo bagle mere kide u kau sigwa pre ye degigl gagl ake i mitna edenaiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrukwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Ana taragl yegl mere plau dugo, Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta Jisas wakai kanugwa ikra ye Jisas moglmedi kandre, Pita yegl di togwa, I Yaglno Kade moglmiwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, Saimon Pita prisre, ye ir gaglmo okna gugl edugwa i edidre, puglo di, nigl kuba si ede ogwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ogwa ba Jisas duglo beglkwa yagl tau i, ye degigl gagl ake gu didre, baglkugl aware si, ede wigwa. Ye ede nigle meda unaiglkwa i, eglke moglkrikwa ba 100 mita mere yegl meglkwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ana ye ede meda udre, kanigwa i, buglo bagle ya bret tau ye nenaiglkwa pre doga sigr mina de yogo, kanigwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Kanigo, Jisas ye yegl di togwa, Ene buglo bagle erme sigwa i, tau yuio dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Yegl dugwa pre Saimon Pita degigl gagl ake gu di yu meda edugwa. Buglo bagle atne meglkwa i, podo podo 153 meglkwa ba degigl gagl i, biglki dikrukwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Ana Jisas ye di te, Ene u kaya mokna neo dugwa. Yegl dugo, ye duglo beglkwa yagl i, ye Yagl Kade moglsa moglmedi prisre, kudugl gogl, Ene ira motne? di prikrikwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Ana Jisas bret ya buglo bagle ake yubu si, duglo beglkwa yagl nenaiglmedi togwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Jisas goglsre, adigl u kor pidre, ye duglo beglkwa yagl meglmara plau dugwa i, erme ege suota mere erukwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas Pita di tedre, Ene na sipsipna sugl moglo dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ana Jisas ye duglo beglkwa yagl bogl kaya mokna ne kodigo, Jisas ye Saimon Pita yegl di prukwa, Saimon, ene Jon wam motnga i, ene den mudun natnga i, ene yagl kane magigl meglkwa i, narimere egre teidi pitno? dugwa. Dugo, Pita, Owo, Yagl Kade, ene wakai kaniga i, enene pitniwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas, Na sipsipna nagigle meglkwa i, ene kugl wakai nenaiglmedi to dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Didre, aglke kor ege namba 2 yegl dugwa, Saimon, Jon wam motnga i, ene den mudun natno? dugwa. Dugo, Pita di ikne ede, Owo, Yagl Kade, na ene wakai kaniga i, enene pitniwe dugwa. Dugo, Jisas, Na sipsipna meglkwa i, suglno moglo dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Didre, aglke kor ege namba 3 yegl dugwa, Saimon, Jon wam motnga i, na wakai kano? dugwa. Ana Jisas ye ege suota, Na wakai kano? dumara i pre Pita dem muduo yubun dogo, ye di ikne ede, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene taragl mudu pre kan etnga. Ene wakai kaniga i, enene pitniwe dugwa. Yegl dugo, Jisas, Na sipsipna meglkwa i, ene ye kugl wakai nenaiglmedi to dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Na ene kaima di teiga. Ene gakamugl motnga igne, enene kumagl dedre, ede aglo mere enagledi pitnga i, pitnere wan motnga. Ba ene kidagl yenatnga igne, ene ogon ake prak edin, yoba pere ta ene kumagl de tedre, ene pikragledi pratnara i, ene auro i ede enaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Jisas ka yegl dugwa i, Pita siragl mere okuo goglsre, God kagie kade tenabere obuno di togwa. Ye ka yegl di kodidre, Pita di te, Na duglo boglo dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita ye Jon pre Jisas kira pogl prukwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Ana Pita kan ake tedre, Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl ta Jisas wakai kanugwa ikra, mokonomugl ugo, kanugwa. Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl i, ye okna kaya mokna neigwa igne, ye bre i pi Jisas pirie mina edidre, ye di pre, Yagl Kade yo, ira ene i pi kudanen ikne ogono mina yenabe? dugwa ikra moglkwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Ana Pita yagl i kandre, Jisas di pre, yegl dugwa, Yagl Kade yo, yagl i we, ye moglmara siragl taragl plau dinabe? dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yegl dugo, Jisas ye di te, Na ye kor mogl pai moran, ede ikne unagledi praglka i, i ene kogonen ta pamedi pitno? Ene yoko na duglo boglo dugwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Ana Jisas ka yegl dugwa i pre pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara ka i wai di ogo, ye prikwa i, Jisas duglo boglkwa yagl i, ta goglkrabuka pre dumedi prikwa. Ba Jisas ye kaima ta goglkrabiwe dikrukwa. Ye dugwa i, Na ye kor mogl pai moran, ede ikne unagledi pribo, ene kogonen pamedi pitno? dugwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ana Jisas yaglmo ta pre dugwa i, taragl kane kane plau dumere mere buk mina paugwa i, ye boglkwa paugwa. Te, ye ka bogl atne edidre, di nogugl ede togwa i, kaima kuno ere pamedi prumga.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Ana Jisas kogon mere kide ama tau erukwa. Na prika i, yoba ere mogl, ye kogon kane kane erukwa i, mudu bogl, bogl, epigl sinamnedi eribi, ye buk mere kide kaima boraiglkwa pre buk i, dumo makan mudu si kau sinan, agai kaima ta yeikrabedi prika.<figure style="fig" alt="Scrolls" file="hk00153b.tif" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="21.25" /><verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>